 - ACT エコシステム ローカル開発","ko":"dev 설정 가이드 - ACT 에코システム 로컬 개발","es":"Guía de configuración de dev para el ecosistema ACT","fr":"Guide de configuration de dev pour l''écosystème ACT","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für dev im ACT-Ökosystem","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Dev: Iniciando o Desenvolvimento ...","ru":"Настройка Dev: Руководство по локальному развитию ИИ Агентов","ar":"دليل إعداد Dev: بدء التطوير المحلي للأدوات الذكية"},"description":{"en":"Unlock efficient development with dev! Learn how to start the full local development stack, use cloudflared tunnel for webhook testing, and optimize your wor...","zh":"了解如何使用 dev Skill 启动完整的本地开发栈，包括可选的 tunnel 用于 webhook 测试","ja":"dev Skill を使用して完全なローカル開発スタックを起動する方法を学び、webhook テスト用の tunnel オプションを含む","ko":"dev Skill을 사용하여 전체 로컬 개발 스택을 시작하는 방법을 배우고 webhook 테스트를 위한 터널 옵션을 포함","es":"Aprende a configurar y utilizar el comando dev para el ecosistema ACT, incluyendo servidor de desarrollo local y pruebas de webhook","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer et utiliser la commande dev pour l''écosystème ACT, y compris le serveur de développement local et les tests de webhook","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie den dev-Befehl für das ACT-Ökosystem konfigurieren und verwenden, einschließlich lokalem Entwicklungsserver und Webhook-Tests","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o dev para desenvolvimento local com comando rápido e webhook de teste","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить dev для локального развития с быстрыми командами и вебхуком для тестирования ИИ Агентов","ar":"تعرف على كيفية إعداد Dev لبدء التطوير المحلي بأوامر سريعة واختبار الويب هوك للأدوات الذكية"},"definition":{"en":"dev is a local development skill for the ACT Ecosystem mono-repo, providing commands for starting dev servers, cron scripts, and infrastructure.","zh":"dev Skill 是一种本地开发工具，用于启动和管理 ACT 生态系统的开发环境","ja":"dev Skill は、ACT エコシステムの開発環境を起動して管理するためのローカル開発ツールです","ko":"dev Skill은 ACT 에코システム의 개발 환경을 시작하고 관리하기 위한 로컬 개발 도구입니다","es":"El comando dev es una herramienta de línea de comandos para configurar y ejecutar el ecosistema ACT de manera local.","fr":"La commande dev est un outil de ligne de commande pour configurer et exécuter l''écosystème ACT de manière locale.","de":"Der dev-Befehl ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool zum Konfigurieren und Ausführen des ACT-Ökosystems auf lokaler Ebene.","pt":"O que é dev? É um skill de desenvolvimento local que fornece comando rápido e webhook de teste","ru":"Что такое dev? Это навык локального развития, который предоставляет быстрые команды и вебхук для тестирования ИИ Агентов","ar":"ما هو Dev? هو مهارة تطوير محلي توفر أوامر سريعة واختبار الويب هوك للأدوات الذكية"},"features":{"en":["Starts dev servers (dashboard + API) using `/dev` or `/dev start` command","Supports starting everything (servers + cron scripts) with `/dev all` command","Enables cloudflared tunnel for webhook testing with `/dev tunnel` command","Provides status check with `/dev status` command","Allows stopping all services with `/dev stop` command","Offers log tailing with `/dev logs` command"],"zh":["启动 dev 服务器（dashboard + API）","启动所有服务（服务器 + cron 脚本）","启动服务器 + cloudflared tunnel 用于 webhook 测试","检查正在运行的服务","停止所有服务","查看最近的日志"],"ja":["dev サーバー（dashboard + API）を起動","すべてのサービス（サーバー + cron スクリプト）を起動","サーバー + cloudflared tunnel を起動して webhook テストを行う","実行中のサービスを確認","すべてのサービスを停止","最近のログを表示"],"ko":["dev 서버(dashboard + API) 시작","모든 서비스(서버 + cron 스크립트) 시작","서버 + cloudflared 터널 시작하여 webhook 테스트","실행 중인 서비스 확인","모든 서비스 중지","최근 로그 보기"],"es":["Inicio del servidor de desarrollo local con el comando `/dev`","Ejecución de scripts y tareas de cron con el comando `/dev all`","Configuración de un túnel para pruebas de webhook con el comando `/dev tunnel`","Verificación del estado de los servicios con el comando `/dev status`","Detención de todos los servicios con el comando `/dev stop`","Visualización de los registros recientes con el comando `/dev logs`"],"fr":["Démarrage du serveur de développement local avec la commande `/dev`","Exécution de scripts et de tâches de cron avec la commande `/dev all`","Configuration d''un tunnel pour les tests de webhook avec la commande `/dev tunnel`","Vérification de l''état des services avec la commande `/dev status`","Arrêt de tous les services avec la commande `/dev stop`","Affichage des journaux récents avec la commande `/dev logs`"],"de":["Starten des lokalen Entwicklungsservers mit dem Befehl `/dev`","Ausführen von Skripten und Cron-Jobs mit dem Befehl `/dev all`","Konfigurieren eines Tunnels für Webhook-Tests mit dem Befehl `/dev tunnel`","Überprüfen des Status der Dienste mit dem Befehl `/dev status`","Beenden aller Dienste mit dem Befehl `/dev stop`","Anzeigen der aktuellen Protokolle mit dem Befehl `/dev logs`"],"pt":["Comando rápido para iniciar o desenvolvimento local","Webhook de teste para desenvolvimento de APIs","Recursos de start, stop e logs para gerenciamento de servidor","Suporte a desenvolvimento de dashboards e APIs","Integração com cloudflared para tunnel de teste"],"ru":["Быстрые команды для начала локального развития ИИ Агентов","Вебхук для тестирования разработки API","Функции start, stop и logs для управления сервером","Поддержка разработки панелей управления и API","Интеграция с cloudflared для туннеля тестирования"],"ar":["أوامر سريعة لبدء التطوير المحلي للأدوات الذكية","اختبار الويب هوك لتطوير واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","ميزات التشغيل والايقاف والسجلات لإدارة الخادم","دعم تطوير لوحات التحكم وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات","التكامل مع cloudflared لاختبار النفق"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use dev","dev setup guide","dev alternative","dev vs docker","dev install","what is dev","dev workflow optimization","dev local development","dev webhook testing"],"zh":["dev Skill","ACT 生态系统","本地开发","webhook 测试","cloudflared tunnel","cron 脚本","dev 服务器","API"],"ja":["dev Skill","ACT エコシステム","ローカル開発","webhook テスト","cloudflared tunnel","cron スクリプト","dev サーバー","API"],"ko":["dev Skill","ACT 에코システム","로컬 개발","webhook 테스트","cloudflared 터널","cron 스크립트","dev 서버","API"],"es":["dev ACT","ecosistema ACT","comando dev","servidor de desarrollo local","pruebas de webhook","scripts de cron","tunnel de webhook","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["dev ACT","écosystème ACT","commande dev","serveur de développement local","tests de webhook","scripts de cron","tunnel de webhook","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["dev ACT","ACT-Ökosystem","dev-Befehl","lokaler Entwicklungsserver","Webhook-Tests","Cron-Jobs","Webhook-Tunnel","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["dev desenvolvimento local","comando rápido dev","webhook de teste dev","desenvolvimento de APIs dev","gerenciamento de servidor dev","cloudflared dev","desenvolvimento de dashboards dev"],"ru":["dev локальное развитие","быстрые команды dev","вебхук для тестирования dev","разработка API dev","управление сервером dev","cloudflared dev","разработка панелей управления dev"],"ar":["dev تطوير محلي","أوامر سريعة dev","اختبار الويب هوك dev","تطوير واجهات برمجة التطبيقات dev","إدارة الخادم dev","cloudflared dev","تطوير لوحات التحكم dev"]}},"owner":"Acurioustractor","repo":"act-global-infrastructure","repoPath":"Acurioustractor/act-global-infrastructure","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.413Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dev","description":"Start local development environment — dev servers, tunnels for webhook testing, health checks, and log tailing. Use when user says start dev, local dev, spin up, test locally, tunnel, or wants to test webhooks.","bodyPreview":"# Local Dev Skill\n\nStart the full local development stack with optional tunnel for webhook testing.\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n| Command | What it does |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `/dev` or `/dev start` | Start dev servers (dashboard + API) |\n| `/dev all` | Start everything (servers + cron scripts) |\n| `/dev tunnel` | Start servers + cloudflared tunnel for webhook testing |\n| `/dev status` | Check what''s running |\n| `/dev stop` | Stop everything |\n| `/dev logs` | Tail recent logs |\n\n## Workflow: Star","body":"# Local Dev Skill\n\nStart the full local development stack with optional tunnel for webhook testing.\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n| Command | What it does |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `/dev` or `/dev start` | Start dev servers (dashboard + API) |\n| `/dev all` | Start everything (servers + cron scripts) |\n| `/dev tunnel` | Start servers + cloudflared tunnel for webhook testing |\n| `/dev status` | Check what''s running |\n| `/dev stop` | Stop everything |\n| `/dev logs` | Tail recent logs |\n\n## Workflow: Start Dev\n\n### Step 1: Check Prerequisites\n\n```bash\n# Check node, pnpm, pm2\nnode --version && pnpm --version && pm2 --version 2>/dev/null || echo \"MISSING: install pm2 globally\"\n```\n\nIf pm2 is missing: `npm install -g pm2`\n\n### Step 2: Start Dev Servers\n\n```bash\ncd /Users/benknight/Code/act-global-infrastructure\n./dev start\n```\n\nThis starts via PM2:\n- **act-frontend**: Next.js on `http://localhost:3002`\n- **act-api**: API server on `http://localhost:3456`\n\n### Step 3: Verify\n\n```bash\n# Wait for servers to be ready\nsleep 5\n\n# Check frontend\ncurl -s -o /dev/null -w \"Dashboard: %{http_code}\\n\" http://localhost:3002/\n\n# Check API\ncurl -s -o /dev/null -w \"API: %{http_code}\\n\" http://localhost:3456/api/health 2>/dev/null || echo \"API: standalone API not needed (Next.js API routes handle it)\"\n\n# PM2 status\npm2 status\n```\n\n### Step 4: Report\n\n```\nLocal dev environment ready:\n- Dashboard: http://localhost:3002\n- API routes: http://localhost:3002/api/...\n```\n\n## Workflow: Tunnel (for webhook testing)\n\nUse this when testing Telegram bot, GHL webhooks, or Xero webhooks locally.\n\n### Step 1: Start Dev Servers (same as above)\n\n### Step 2: Start Cloudflared Tunnel\n\nIMPORTANT: Use `--config /dev/null` to avoid the catch-all 404 from existing config.yml.\n\n```bash\ncloudflared tunnel --config /dev/null --url http://localhost:3002 2>&1 &\n```\n\nWait a few seconds, then grab the tunnel URL from the output (looks like `https://something-random.trycloudflare.com`).\n\n### Step 3: Set Telegram Webhook (if testing bot)\n\n```bash\nTUNNEL_URL=\"<the cloudflared URL>\"\nTELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=\"<from .env.local>\"\n\ncurl -s \"https://api.telegram.org/bot${TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN}/setWebhook\" \\\n  -d \"url=${TUNNEL_URL}/api/telegram/webhook\" \\\n  -d \"secret_token=<TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET from .env.local>\"\n```\n\nVerify:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"https://api.telegram.org/bot${TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN}/getWebhookInfo\" | python3 -m json.tool\n```\n\n### Step 4: Report\n\n```\nTunnel active:\n- Public URL: <tunnel URL>\n- Telegram webhook: set to <tunnel URL>/api/telegram/webhook\n- Test by sending a message to the bot\n```\n\n### Step 5: Cleanup (when done)\n\nIMPORTANT: Reset webhook to production URL when done testing locally.\n\n```bash\ncurl -s \"https://api.telegram.org/bot${TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN}/setWebhook\" \\\n  -d \"url=https://command.act.place/api/telegram/webhook\" \\\n  -d \"secret_token=<TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET>\"\n```\n\nKill the tunnel:\n```bash\npkill -f cloudflared 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n## Workflow: Start Cron Scripts\n\n```bash\ncd /Users/benknight/Code/act-global-infrastructure\n./dev cron\n```\n\nThis starts PM2 cron jobs:\n- `notion-sync` — every 5 min\n- `imessage-sync` — every 15 min\n- `daily-briefing` — 7am AEST\n- `knowledge-pipeline` — 8am AEST\n- `data-freshness` — every 6h\n- Plus: storyteller sync/link, embed-imessages, detect-episodes, agent-learning, meeting-sync\n\n## Workflow: Status & Logs\n\n```bash\n# Status of all PM2 processes\npm2 status\n\n# Tail all logs\npm2 logs --lines 50\n\n# Tail specific service\npm2 logs act-frontend --lines 30\n\n# Check for errors\npm2 logs --err --lines 20\n```\n\n## Workflow: Stop\n\n```bash\n# Stop dev servers only\n./dev stop\n\n# Stop cron scripts only\n./dev stop-cron\n\n# Stop everything\npm2 stop all\n```\n\n## Ports & URLs\n\n| Service | Local URL | Production URL |\n|---------|-----------|---------------|\n| Dashboard | `http://localhost:3002` | `https://command.act.place` |\n| API routes | `http://localhost:3002/api/*` | `https://command.act.place/api/*` |\n| Legacy API | `http://localhost:3456` | (deprecated) |\n| Telegram webhook | `/api/telegram/webhook` | same path |\n| GHL webhook | `/api/webhooks/ghl` | same path |\n| Xero webhook | `/api/webhooks/xero` | same path |\n\n## Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| Port 3001 already in use | `lsof -i :3001` then `kill <PID>` |\n| PM2 not found | `npm install -g pm2` |\n| Cloudflared tunnel 404 | Use `--config /dev/null` flag |\n| Telegram webhook not receiving | Check `getWebhookInfo`, verify secret matches |\n| Env vars not loaded | Check `.env.local` exists in project root |\n| Next.js build errors | Run `npx tsc --noEmit` in `apps/command-center/` first |\n\n## Environment Checklist\n\nThese env vars must be in `.env.local` for full local dev:\n\n**Required:**\n- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`, `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`\n- `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`\n- `OPENAI_API_KEY`\n\n**For Telegram bot testing:**\n- `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN`\n- `TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET`\n- `TELEGRAM_AUTHORIZED_USERS`\n\n**For email/calendar:**\n- `GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY`\n- `GOOGLE_DELEGATED_USERS`\n- `GOOGLE_CALENDAR_ID`\n\n**For finance:**\n- `XERO_CLIENT_ID`, `XERO_CLIENT_SECRET`, `XERO_TENANT_ID`, `XERO_REFRESH_TOKEN`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:09.547Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing streamlined local development with webhook testing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要简化本地开发和 webhook 测试功能的全栈代理。","ja":"フルスタックエージェントがストリーミングされたローカル開発と webhook テスト機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"전체 스택 에이전트가 스트리밍된 로컬 개발 및 웹후크 테스트 기능을 필요로 할 경우에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan un desarrollo local optimizado con capacidades de prueba de webhook.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin d''un développement local rationalisé avec des capacités de test de webhook.","de":"Perfekt für Full Stack-Agents, die ein optimiertes lokales Entwicklungsumfeld mit Webhook-Testfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de desenvolvimento local simplificado com capacidades de teste de webhook.","ru":"Идеально для Full Stack агентов, требующих упрощенного локального разработки с возможностями тестирования вебхука.","ar":"مثالي لعميل البرمجيات الكامل الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير محلي مبسط مع إمكانيات اختبار الويب هوك."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to start the full local development stack with optional tunnel for webhook testing, utilizing cloudflared tunnel and cron scripts for streamlined workflow automation and API testing.","zh":"赋予代理开始完整的本地开发堆栈的能力，具有可选的 tunnel 用于 webhook 测试，利用 cloudflared tunnel 和 cron 脚本实现工作流自动化和 API 测试。","ja":"エージェントがフルローカル開発スタックを開始し、webhook テスト用のオプションのトンネルを使用できるようにします。cloudflared トンネルと cron スクリプトを使用して、ワークフローの自動化と API テストを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 전체 로컬 개발 스택을 시작하고 웹후크 테스트를 위한 선택적 터널을 사용할 수 있도록 합니다. cloudflared 터널 및 cron 스크립트를 사용하여 워크플ロー 자동화 및 API 테스트를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a iniciar la pila de desarrollo local completa con un túnel opcional para pruebas de webhook, utilizando un túnel cloudflared y scripts cron para la automatización del flujo de trabajo y las pruebas de API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de lancer la pile de développement local complète avec un tunnel facultatif pour les tests de webhook, en utilisant un tunnel cloudflared et des scripts cron pour l''automatisation du workflow et les tests d''API.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, den vollen lokalen Entwicklungstack zu starten, optional mit einem Tunnel für Webhook-Tests, unter Einsatz eines cloudflared-Tunnels und Cron-Skripten für die Automatisierung der Arbeitsabläufe und API-Tests.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a iniciar a pilha de desenvolvimento local completa com túnel opcional para teste de webhook, utilizando túnel cloudflared e scripts cron para automação de fluxo de trabalho e teste de API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью начать полную локальную разработку со стеком с опциональным туннелем для тестирования вебхука, используя туннель cloudflared и скрипты cron для автоматизации рабочего процесса и тестирования API.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية بدء تطور محلي كامل مع حزمة تطور محلية مع نفق اختياري لاختبار الويب هوك، مستخدمًا نفق cloudflared وبرامج cron للتحكم التلقائي في تدفق العمل واختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات."},"useCases":{"en":["Starting dev servers for dashboard and API testing","Automating cron scripts for scheduled tasks","Debugging webhook integrations with cloudflared tunnel"],"zh":["启动开发服务器进行仪表盘和 API 测试","自动化 cron 脚本以执行定时任务","使用 cloudflared 隧道调试 webhook 集成"],"ja":["ダッシュボードと API テスト用の開発サーバーの起動","定期的なタスクの実行のための cron スクリプトの自動化","cloudflared トンネルを使用した webhook 統合のデバッグ"],"ko":["대시보드 및 API 테스트를 위한 개발 서버 시작","정기적인 작업을 위한 cron 스크립트 자동화","cloudflared 터널을 사용한 웹후크 통합 디버깅"],"es":["Inicio de servidores de desarrollo para pruebas de dashboard y API","Automatización de scripts cron para tareas programadas","Depuración de integraciones de webhook con túnel cloudflared"],"fr":["Démarrage des serveurs de développement pour les tests de tableau de bord et d''API","Automatisation des scripts cron pour les tâches planifiées","Débogage des intégrations de webhook avec un tunnel cloudflared"],"de":["Starten von Entwicklungsservern für Dashboard- und API-Tests","Automatisierung von Cron-Skripten für geplante Aufgaben","Fehlerbehebung von Webhook-Integrationen mit cloudflared-Tunnel"],"pt":["Iniciar servidores de desenvolvimento para teste de painel e API","Automatizar scripts cron para tarefas agendadas","Depurar integrações de webhook com túnel cloudflared"],"ru":["Запуск серверов разработки для тестирования панели и API","Автоматизация скриптов cron для запланированных задач","Отладка интеграций вебхука с туннелем cloudflared"],"ar":["تشغيل خوادم التطوير لاختبار لوحة التحكم وواجهة برمجة التطبيقات","توفير برامج cron لل مهام المجدولة","تصحيح أخطاء دمج الويب هوك مع نفق cloudflared"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the ACT Ecosystem mono-repo","Limited to local development environment"],"zh":["需要访问 ACT 生态系统 mono-repo","仅限本地开发环境"],"ja":["ACT エコシステムの mono-repo へのアクセスが必要","ローカル開発環境でのみ使用可能"],"ko":["ACT 생태계의 mono-repo에 대한 액세스가 필요","로컬 개발 환경에서만 사용 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso al mono-repositorio de ACT Ecosystem","Limitado al entorno de desarrollo local"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au mono-dépôt de l''écosystème ACT","Limité à l''environnement de développement local"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Mono-Repository von ACT Ecosystem","Begrenzt auf die lokale Entwicklungsumgebung"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório mono do Ecossistema ACT","Limitado ao ambiente de desenvolvimento local"],"ru":["Требует доступа к моно-репозиторию Экосистемы ACT","Ограничен локальной средой разработки"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى المستودع التلقائي لنظام البيئة","محدود بالبيئة المحلية للتطوير"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"5c0d92b65460df26b34e24c1f2cf4744c106fe1c0d580d2dd6353cf028adf3df","qualityScore":42}');
