Sonar family models.","zh":"Perplexity-Tools 是一款优化响应质量的 AI 工具，通过 Python CLI 执行 Perplexity AI 查询","ja":"Perplexity-Tools は、応答品質を最適化する AI エージェントで、Python CLI を使用して Perplexity AI クエリを実行します","ko":"Perplexity-Tools는 응답 품질을 최적화하는 AI 도구로, Python CLI를 통해 Perplexity AI 쿼리를 실행합니다","es":"Perplexity-tools es un conjunto de herramientas de IA que optimizan la calidad de las respuestas mediante modelos especializados","fr":"Perplexity-tools est un ensemble d''outils d''IA qui optimisent la qualité des réponses via des modèles spécialisés","de":"Perplexity-tools ist ein Satz von IA-Tools, die die Antwortqualität durch spezialisierte Modelle optimieren","pt":"O que é Perplexity-Tools? É uma ferramenta de IA que otimiza a qualidade de resposta","ru":"Что такое Perplexity-Tools? Это инструмент ИИ, который оптимизирует качество ответа","ar":"ما هي أدوات Perplexity؟ هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تحسن جودة الاستجابة"},"features":{"en":["Execute Perplexity AI queries via Python CLI","Supports Sonar family models, including sonar, sonar-pro, sonar-reasoning, sonar-reasoning-pro, and sonar-deep-research","API key auto-injection via 1Password","Utilizes specialized models for optimized response quality","Citation tokens no longer billed for sonar and sonar-pro models"],"zh":["支持 Sonar 家族模型，包括 sonar、sonar-pro、sonar-reasoning、sonar-reasoning-pro 和 sonar-deep-research","自动注入 API 密钥通过 1Password","通过 Python CLI 执行 Perplexity AI 查询","支持 citation tokens，无需额外计费","支持深度检索和实时推理"],"ja":["Sonar ファミリーモデルをサポート（sonar、sonar-pro、sonar-reasoning、sonar-reasoning-pro、sonar-deep-research）","API キーを自動インジェクションする（1Password を使用）","Python CLI を使用して Perplexity AI クエリを実行","citation tokens をサポート（別途課金なし）","深度検索とリアルタイム推論をサポート"],"ko":["Sonar 가족 모델 지원（sonar、sonar-pro、sonar-reasoning、sonar-reasoning-pro、sonar-deep-research）","API 키 자동 주입（1Password 사용）","Python CLI를 통해 Perplexity AI 쿼리 실행","citation tokens 지원（별도 과금 없음）","깊은 검색과 실시간 추론 지원"],"es":["Ejecución de consultas de IA de Perplexity mediante la CLI de Python","Modelos de la familia Sonar para una respuesta de alta calidad","Inyección automática de clave API mediante 1Password","Soporte para modelos Sonar, Sonar-pro, Sonar-reasoning, Sonar-reasoning-pro y Sonar-deep-research"],"fr":["Exécution de requêtes IA Perplexity via la CLI Python","Modèles de la famille Sonar pour une réponse de haute qualité","Injection automatique de clé API via 1Password","Prise en charge des modèles Sonar, Sonar-pro, Sonar-reasoning, Sonar-reasoning-pro et Sonar-deep-research"],"de":["Ausführung von Perplexity-AI-Abfragen über die Python-CLI","Modelle der Sonar-Familie für eine hochwertige Antwort","Automatische API-Schlüsselinjektion via 1Password","Unterstützung für Modelle Sonar, Sonar-pro, Sonar-reasoning, Sonar-reasoning-pro und Sonar-deep-research"],"pt":["Execução de consultas de IA via CLI Python","Chave de API auto-injetada via 1Password","Suporte a modelos Sonar family (sonar, sonar-pro, sonar-reasoning, sonar-reasoning-pro, sonar-deep-research)","Citation tokens não cobrados para sonar/sonar-pro","Integração com modelos de IA especializados"],"ru":["Выполнение запросов ИИ через Python CLI","Автоматическая инъекция ключа API через 1Password","Поддержка моделей семейства Sonar (sonar, sonar-pro, sonar-reasoning, sonar-reasoning-pro, sonar-deep-research)","Токены цитирования не взимаются за sonar/sonar-pro","Интеграция с специализированными моделями ИИ"],"ar":["تشغيل استفسارات الذكاء الاصطناعي عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر Python","مفتاح API المُقدم تلقائيًا عبر 1Password","دعم نماذج عائلة Sonar (sonar, sonar-pro, sonar-reasoning, sonar-reasoning-pro, sonar-deep-research)","tokens الاستشهاد لا يتم فرضها على sonar/sonar-pro","التكامل مع نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي المتخصصة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use perplexity-tools","perplexity-tools setup guide","perplexity-tools alternative","perplexity-tools vs sonar","perplexity-tools install","what is perplexity-tools","perplexity-tools python cli","sonar family models","perplexity ai queries"],"zh":["Perplexity-Tools","AI 工具","Sonar 家族模型","Python CLI","自动注入 API 密钥","citation tokens","深度检索","实时推理"],"ja":["Perplexity-Tools","AI エージェント","Sonar ファミリーモデル","Python CLI","自動インジェクション API キー","citation tokens","深度検索","リアルタイム推論"],"ko":["Perplexity-Tools","AI 도구","Sonar 가족 모델","Python CLI","自動 주입 API 키","citation tokens","깊은 검색","실시간 추론"],"es":["herramientas de IA","Perplexity-tools","CLI de Python","modelos de la familia Sonar","respuesta de alta calidad","inyección de clave API","1Password","desarrollo de IA"],"fr":["outils d''IA","Perplexity-tools","CLI Python","modèles de la famille Sonar","réponse de haute qualité","injection de clé API","1Password","développement d''IA"],"de":["IA-Tools","Perplexity-tools","Python-CLI","Modelle der Sonar-Familie","hochwertige Antwort","API-Schlüsselinjektion","1Password","IA-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Perplexity-Tools","Ferramentas de IA","CLI Python","Chave de API","1Password","Modelos Sonar","Desenvolvimento de IA","Otimização de resposta"],"ru":["Perplexity-Tools","Инструменты ИИ","Python CLI","Ключ API","1Password","Модели Sonar","Разработка ИИ","Оптимизация ответа"],"ar":["أدوات Perplexity","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","واجهة سطر الأوامر Python","مفتاح API","1Password","نماذج Sonar","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين الاستجابة"]}},"owner":"bsamiee","repo":"Parametric_Portal","repoPath":"bsamiee/Parametric_Portal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"perplexity-tools","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# [H1][PERPLEXITY-TOOLS]\n>**Dictum:** *Specialized models optimize response quality.*\n\n<br>\n\nExecute Perplexity AI queries via Python CLI. API key auto-injected via 1Password.\n\n[IMPORTANT] Sonar family models (Feb 2026): `sonar` (lightweight search), `sonar-pro` (deeper retrieval, 2x more results), `sonar-reasoning` (real-time reasoning), `sonar-reasoning-pro` (DeepSeek-R1, visible reasoning), `sonar-deep-research` (long-form reports). Citation tokens no longer billed for sonar/sonar-pro.\n\n---\n#","body":"# [H1][PERPLEXITY-TOOLS]\n>**Dictum:** *Specialized models optimize response quality.*\n\n<br>\n\nExecute Perplexity AI queries via Python CLI. API key auto-injected via 1Password.\n\n[IMPORTANT] Sonar family models (Feb 2026): `sonar` (lightweight search), `sonar-pro` (deeper retrieval, 2x more results), `sonar-reasoning` (real-time reasoning), `sonar-reasoning-pro` (DeepSeek-R1, visible reasoning), `sonar-deep-research` (long-form reports). Citation tokens no longer billed for sonar/sonar-pro.\n\n---\n## [1][COMMANDS]\n\n| [CMD]    | [ARGS]                    | [MODEL]             |\n| -------- | ------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| ask      | `<query>`                 | sonar               |\n| pro      | `<query>`                 | sonar-pro           |\n| research | `<query> [strip]`         | sonar-deep-research |\n| reason   | `<query> [strip]`         | sonar-reasoning-pro |\n| search   | `<query> [max] [country]` | sonar               |\n\n---\n## [2][USAGE]\n\n```bash\n# Quick question with citations (lightweight)\nuv run .claude/skills/perplexity-tools/scripts/perplexity.py ask \"What is Effect-TS?\"\n\n# Pro question with deeper retrieval\nuv run .claude/skills/perplexity-tools/scripts/perplexity.py pro \"Compare Vite 7 vs Turbopack bundling strategies\"\n\n# Deep research (10min timeout)\nuv run .claude/skills/perplexity-tools/scripts/perplexity.py research \"React 19 new features\"\n\n# Deep research, strip thinking tags\nuv run .claude/skills/perplexity-tools/scripts/perplexity.py research \"Vite 7 migration\" strip\n\n# Reasoning task\nuv run .claude/skills/perplexity-tools/scripts/perplexity.py reason \"Compare Effect vs RxJS\"\n\n# Web search with max results\nuv run .claude/skills/perplexity-tools/scripts/perplexity.py search \"Nx 22 features\" 5\n```\n\n---\n## [3][ARGUMENTS]\n\n**ask**: `<query>`\n- `query` — Question to ask (required)\n- Model: `sonar` (fast, lightweight search)\n\n**pro**: `<query>`\n- `query` — Question requiring deeper retrieval (required)\n- Model: `sonar-pro` (enhanced search, 2x results)\n\n**research**: `<query> [strip]`\n- `query` — Research topic (required)\n- `strip` — Pass `strip` to remove `<think>` tags from response\n- Model: `sonar-deep-research` (long-form, source-dense reports)\n\n**reason**: `<query> [strip]`\n- `query` — Reasoning problem (required)\n- `strip` — Pass `strip` to remove `<think>` tags from response\n- Model: `sonar-reasoning-pro` (DeepSeek-R1, visible chain-of-thought)\n\n**search**: `<query> [max] [country]`\n- `query` — Search query (required)\n- `max` — Max results (default: `10`)\n- `country` — Country code to focus results (e.g., `US`, `GB`)\n\n---\n## [4][OUTPUT]\n\nCommands return: `{\"status\": \"success|error\", ...}`.\n\n| [INDEX] | [CMD]      | [RESPONSE]                       |\n| :-----: | ---------- | -------------------------------- |\n|   [1]   | `ask`      | `{query, response, citations[]}` |\n|   [2]   | `pro`      | `{query, response, citations[]}` |\n|   [3]   | `research` | `{query, response, citations[]}` |\n|   [4]   | `reason`   | `{query, response}`              |\n|   [5]   | `search`   | `{query, results[]}`             |\n\n---\n## [5][ENVIRONMENT]\n\n| [VAR]                | [REQUIRED] | [DESCRIPTION]                           |\n| -------------------- | ---------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `PERPLEXITY_API_KEY` | Yes        | Perplexity API key (1Password injected) |\n\n---\n## [6][ERROR_HANDLING]\n\n- HTTP errors print `[ERROR] <status>: <body>` and exit 1\n- Rate limit (429): print retry guidance and exit 1\n- `research` command uses 10-minute timeout; long-running queries may time out\n- `reason` output includes `<think>` tags by default; pass `strip` to remove\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:09.755Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Analysis Agents needing efficient Perplexity AI query execution via Python CLI.","zh":"适合需要通过Python CLI高效执行Perplexity AI查询的AI分析代理。","ja":"Python CLIを介してPerplexity AIクエリを効率的に実行する必要があるAI分析エージェントに適しています。","ko":"Python CLI를 통해 Perplexity AI 쿼리를 효율적으로 실행해야 하는 AI 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de IA que necesitan una ejecución eficiente de consultas de Perplexity AI a través de Python CLI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse d''IA nécessitant une exécution efficace des requêtes Perplexity AI via Python CLI.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Analyse-Agents, die eine effiziente Ausführung von Perplexity AI-Abfragen über Python CLI benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de IA que necessitam de execução eficiente de consultas de IA Perplexity via Python CLI.","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа ИИ, которым требуется эффективное выполнение запросов ИИ Perplexity через Python CLI.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ كفء لاستعلامات الذكاء الاصطناعي Perplexity عبر Python CLI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute Perplexity AI queries using specialized models like sonar, sonar-pro, sonar-reasoning, and sonar-deep-research, optimizing response quality with auto-injected API keys via 1Password, and leveraging CLI for streamlined interactions.","zh":"赋予代理执行Perplexity AI查询的能力，使用诸如sonar、sonar-pro、sonar-reasoning和sonar-deep-research等专用模型，通过1Password自动注入API密钥来优化响应质量，并利用CLI进行简化交互。","ja":"エージェントがPerplexity AIクエリを実行する能力を付与し、sonar、sonar-pro、sonar-reasoning、sonar-deep-researchなどの専用モデルを使用して、1Passwordを介してAPIキーを自動的に注入してレスポンスの品質を最適化し、CLIを使用してインタラクションを簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트가 Perplexity AI 쿼리를 실행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, sonar, sonar-pro, sonar-reasoning, sonar-deep-research 같은 특수 모델을 사용하여 1Password를 통해 API 키를 자동으로 주입하여 응답 품질을 최적화하고, CLI를 사용하여 상호 작용을 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar consultas de Perplexity AI utilizando modelos especializados como sonar, sonar-pro, sonar-reasoning y sonar-deep-research, optimizando la calidad de la respuesta con claves de API inyectadas automáticamente a través de 1Password y aprovechando CLI para interacciones optimizadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des requêtes Perplexity AI en utilisant des modèles spécialisés comme sonar, sonar-pro, sonar-reasoning et sonar-deep-research, en optimisant la qualité de la réponse avec des clés d''API injectées automatiquement via 1Password et en exploitant CLI pour des interactions rationalisées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Perplexity AI-Abfragen mit spezialisierten Modellen wie sonar, sonar-pro, sonar-reasoning und sonar-deep-research auszuführen, die Antwortqualität mit automatisch injizierten API-Schlüsseln über 1Password zu optimieren und CLI für optimierte Interaktionen zu nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar consultas de IA Perplexity usando modelos especializados como sonar, sonar-pro, sonar-reasoning e sonar-deep-research, otimizando a qualidade da resposta com chaves de API injetadas automaticamente via 1Password e aproveitando o CLI para interações transversais.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять запросы ИИ Perplexity с использованием специализированных моделей, таких как sonar, sonar-pro, sonar-reasoning и sonar-deep-research, оптимизируя качество ответа с помощью автоматически внедряемых ключей API через 1Password и используя CLI для оптимизированного взаимодействия.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنفيذ استعلامات الذكاء الاصطناعي Perplexity باستخدام نماذج متخصصة مثل sonar و sonar-pro و sonar-reasoning و sonar-deep-research، وتحسين جودة الاستجابة مع مفاتيح API المُقامة تلقائيًا عبر 1Password، وتحقيق التفاعلات المُتفرقة عبر CLI."},"useCases":{"en":["Executing Perplexity AI queries for optimized response quality","Utilizing sonar family models for lightweight search, deeper retrieval, and real-time reasoning","Automating API key management via 1Password for seamless query execution"],"zh":["执行Perplexity AI查询以优化响应质量","使用sonar系列模型进行轻量级搜索、更深入的检索和实时推理","通过1Password自动化API密钥管理以实现无缝查询执行"],"ja":["レスポンスの品質を最適化するためにPerplexity AIクエリを実行する","sonarファミリモデルを使用して軽量検索、より深い抽出、リアルタイム推論を行う","1Passwordを介してAPIキーの管理を自動化してクエリの実行をスムーズにする"],"ko":["응답 품질을 최적화하기 위해 Perplexity AI 쿼리를 실행하는 것","sonar 계열 모델을 사용하여 경량 검색, 더 깊은 검색, 실시간 추론을 수행하는 것","1Password를 통해 API 키 관리를 자동화하여 쿼리 실행을 무결하게 하는 것"],"es":["Ejecutar consultas de Perplexity AI para una calidad de respuesta optimizada","Utilizar modelos de la familia sonar para una búsqueda ligera, una recuperación más profunda y un razonamiento en tiempo real","Automatizar la gestión de claves de API a través de 1Password para una ejecución de consultas sin problemas"],"fr":["Exécuter des requêtes Perplexity AI pour une qualité de réponse optimisée","Utiliser des modèles de la famille sonar pour une recherche légère, une récupération plus approfondie et un raisonnement en temps réel","Automatiser la gestion des clés d''API via 1Password pour une exécution de requêtes sans problème"],"de":["Perplexity AI-Abfragen für eine optimierte Antwortqualität ausführen","Sonar-Familienmodelle für leichte Suche, tiefere Abruf und Echtzeit-Schlußfolgerung nutzen","API-Schlüsselverwaltung über 1Password automatisieren, um eine reibungslose Abfrageausführung zu ermöglichen"],"pt":["Executando consultas de IA Perplexity para qualidade de resposta otimizada","Utilizando modelos da família sonar para busca leve, recuperação mais profunda e raciocínio em tempo real","Automatizando a gestão de chaves de API via 1Password para execução de consultas sem interrupções"],"ru":["Выполнение запросов ИИ Perplexity для оптимизированного качества ответа","Использование моделей семейства sonar для лёгкого поиска, более глубокого извлечения и реального времени рассуждений","Автоматизация управления ключами API через 1Password для бесперебойного выполнения запросов"],"ar":["تنفيذ استعلامات الذكاء الاصطناعي Perplexity لجودة استجابة مُحسنة","استخدام نماذج عائلة sonar للبحث الخفيف والاسترجاع العميق والاستدلال في الوقت الفعلي","تأتميم إدارة مفاتيح API عبر 1Password لتنفيذ استعلامات دون انقطاع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Perplexity AI API key","Dependent on 1Password for API key auto-injection","Limited to Python CLI execution"],"zh":["需要Perplexity AI API密钥","依赖1Password进行API密钥自动注入","仅限Python CLI执行"],"ja":["Perplexity AI APIキーが必要","APIキー自動注入に1Passwordに依存する","Python CLIでの実行のみ"],"ko":["Perplexity AI API 키가 필요함","API 키 자동 주입에 1Password에 의존함","Python CLI에서만 실행 가능"],"es":["Requiere una clave de API de Perplexity AI","Depende de 1Password para la inyección automática de claves de API","Limitado a la ejecución de Python CLI"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé d''API Perplexity AI","Dépend de 1Password pour l''injection automatique des clés d''API","Limité à l''exécution de Python CLI"],"de":["Benötigt einen Perplexity AI-API-Schlüssel","Ist von 1Password für die automatische Injektion von API-Schlüsseln abhängig","Begrenzt auf die Ausführung von Python CLI"],"pt":["Requer chave de API do Perplexity AI","Dependente do 1Password para injeção automática de chaves de API","Limitado à execução via Python CLI"],"ru":["Требуется ключ API ИИ Perplexity","Зависит от 1Password для автоматической инъекции ключей API","Ограничен выполнением через Python CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح API للذكاء الاصطناعي Perplexity","يعتمد على 1Password لإقامة مفاتيح API تلقائيًا","محدود بالتنفيذ عبر Python CLI"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7d61686983e9ccc890a2ed9df882f902512e2ad0869d63abf7eb06c209e78532","qualityScore":42}');
