ي"},"definition":{"en":"Specture is a spec-driven development system that uses design documents in the specs/ directory to describe planned changes and implementation tasks.","zh":"Specture是一种设计文档驱动的开发系统","ja":"Spectureは仕様駆動型ソフトウェアアーキテクチャシステム","ko":"Specture는 설계 문서駆动 개발 시스템","es":"Specture es un sistema de arquitectura de software que utiliza especificaciones para guiar el desarrollo de software","fr":"Specture est un système d''architecture logicielle qui utilise des spécifications pour guider le développement de logiciels","de":"Specture ist ein Software-Architektur-System, das Spezifikationen zur Steuerung der Software-Entwicklung verwendet","pt":"O que é Specture? É um sistema de arquitetura de software que utiliza especificações para guiar o desenvolvimento","ru":"Что такое Specture? Это система разработки на основе спецификаций, которая использует документы дизайна для описания изменений","ar":"ما هو Specture؟ هو نظام هندسة البرمجيات القائم على المواصفات، الذي يستخدم وثائق التصميم لوصف التغييرات"},"features":{"en":["Uses YAML frontmatter to store spec numbers","Supports slug-only filenames for new specs","Allows older specs to retain NNN-slug.md filenames","Includes design rationale, decisions, and implementation task lists in specs","Stores specs in the specs/ directory","Uses spec numbers stored in the number field for organization"],"zh":["设计文档驱动开发","Specs目录管理","YAML前置字段支持","任务列表管理","Slug-only文件命名支持"],"ja":["仕様駆動型ソフトウェアアーキテクチャ","Specsディレクトリ管理","YAMLフロントマター対応","タスクリスト管理","スラッグのみのファイル命名対応"],"ko":["설계 문서駆动 개발","Specs 디렉토리 관리","YAML 전置 필드 지원","작업 목록 관리","슬러그のみ 파일命명 지원"],"es":["Documentos de diseño en el directorio specs/","Especificaciones con justificación del diseño y lista de tareas de implementación","Uso de números de especificación en el campo YAML frontmatter number","Compatibilidad con nombres de archivo slug-only y NNN-slug.md","Mejora del flujo de trabajo de desarrollo con especificaciones claras","Implementación de cambios de diseño y refactorización"],"fr":["Documents de conception dans le répertoire specs/","Spécifications avec justification de la conception et liste de tâches d''implémentation","Utilisation de numéros de spécification dans le champ YAML frontmatter number","Compatibilité avec des noms de fichier slug-only et NNN-slug.md","Amélioration du flux de travail de développement avec des spécifications claires","Implémentation de changements de conception et de refactoring"],"de":["Design-Dokumente im specs/-Verzeichnis","Spezifikationen mit Designbegründung und Liste von Implementierungsaufgaben","Verwendung von Spezifikationsnummern im YAML-Frontmatter-Feld number","Kompatibilität mit Dateinamen im Format slug-only und NNN-slug.md","Verbesserung des Entwicklungsworkflows mit klaren Spezifikationen","Implementierung von Designänderungen und Refactoring"],"pt":["Especificações armazenadas em arquivos Markdown","Utiliza YAML frontmatter para armazenar números de especificação","Suporta nomes de arquivos com slug e números","Permite a criação de listas de tarefas de implementação","Facilita a documentação de design e decisões"],"ru":["Спецификации хранятся в файлах Markdown","Использует YAML frontmatter для хранения номеров спецификаций","Поддерживает имена файлов с слагом и номерами","Позволяет создавать списки задач для реализации","Облегчает документирование дизайна и решений"],"ar":["التفاصيل المخزنة في ملفات Markdown","يستخدم YAML frontmatter لتخزين أرقام المواصفات","يدعم أسماء الملفات ذات السلاج والأرقام","يسمح بإنشاء قوائم المهام للتطبيق","يتسهل وثائق التصميم والقرارات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use specture","what is specture","specture alternative","specture vs architecture systems","specture install","specture setup guide","specture yaml specs","spec driven development","specture specs directory"],"zh":["Specture","设计文档驱动开发","Specs目录","YAML前置字段","任务列表管理","Slug-only文件命名","AI开发工具","软件开发系统"],"ja":["Specture","仕様駆動型ソフトウェアアーキテクチャ","Specsディレクトリ","YAMLフロントマター","タスクリスト管理","スラッグのみのファイル命名","AIエージェント","ソフトウェア開発システム"],"ko":["Specture","설계 문서駆动 개발","Specs 디렉토리","YAML 전置 필드","작업 목록 관리","슬러그のみ 파일命명","AI 에이전트","소프트웨어 개발 시스템"],"es":["Specture","arquitectura de software","especificaciones","desarrollo de software","documentos de diseño","yaml frontmatter","números de especificación","mejora del flujo de trabajo","herramientas de desarrollo","AI Agents","Herramientas de desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Specture","architecture logicielle","spécifications","développement de logiciels","documents de conception","yaml frontmatter","numéros de spécification","amélioration du flux de travail","outils de développement","Agents IA","Outils de développement de logiciels"],"de":["Specture","Software-Architektur","Spezifikationen","Software-Entwicklung","Design-Dokumente","yaml-Frontmatter","Spezifikationsnummern","Verbesserung des Entwicklungsworkflows","Entwicklungstools","KI-Agents","Software-Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Specture","arquitetura de software","desenvolvimento baseado em especificações","documentos de design","YAML frontmatter","Markdown","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Specture","система разработки на основе спецификаций","ИИ Агенты","документы дизайна","YAML frontmatter","Markdown","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Specture","نظام هندسة البرمجيات القائم على المواصفات","الوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","وثائق التصميم","YAML frontmatter","Markdown","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"specture-system","repo":"specture","repoPath":"specture-system/specture","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"specture","description":"Follow the Specture System for spec-driven development. Use when creating, implementing, or managing specs.","bodyPreview":"# Specture System\n\nSpecture is a spec-driven development system. Specs are design documents in the `specs/` directory that describe planned changes — features, refactors, redesigns, tooling improvements. Each spec contains the design rationale, decisions, and an implementation task list.\n\nSpec numbers are stored in the YAML frontmatter `number` field. New specs use slug-only filenames (e.g., `my-feature.md`). Older specs may retain `NNN-slug.md` filenames — both naming patterns are valid.\n\n## Im","body":"# Specture System\n\nSpecture is a spec-driven development system. Specs are design documents in the `specs/` directory that describe planned changes — features, refactors, redesigns, tooling improvements. Each spec contains the design rationale, decisions, and an implementation task list.\n\nSpec numbers are stored in the YAML frontmatter `number` field. New specs use slug-only filenames (e.g., `my-feature.md`). Older specs may retain `NNN-slug.md` filenames — both naming patterns are valid.\n\n## Implementation Workflow\n\nWhen implementing a spec, follow this loop:\n\n1. Run `specture status` to see the current spec and next task\n2. Complete one or more tasks from the task list\n3. Edit the spec file: change `- [ ]` to `- [x]` for every task completed in this commit\n4. Stage both the implementation files **and** the spec file update\n5. Commit together with a conventional commit message (e.g., `feat: implement feature X`)\n6. Push the changes\n7. Repeat from step 1\n\n**Critical rules:**\n\n- Every commit that completes a task MUST include the spec file checkbox update alongside the implementation changes. Never commit implementation without the corresponding `- [x]` update. This is the most important rule.\n- If a single commit completes multiple tasks, check off all of them in that same commit. Do NOT make separate empty commits just to check off tasks that were already implemented.\n- Do NOT edit spec design decisions or descriptions without explicit user permission. You may only mark tasks complete and add/remove tasks during implementation.\n- When editing a spec, keep the design decisions section and task list in sync. If a description is updated, update all corresponding task descriptions to match, and vice versa.\n- When all tasks are checked off, update the frontmatter `status` to `completed`.\n\n## CLI Commands\n\nAlways use non-interactive flags. Interactive mode will hang waiting for input.\n\n### specture list and specture status\n\nUse `list` to see all specs at a glance, then `status` to drill into a specific one.\n\n**`specture list`** — overview of all specs (number, status, progress, name).\n\n```bash\nspecture list                            # All specs\nspecture list --status in-progress       # Filter by status\nspecture list --status draft,approved    # Multiple statuses\nspecture list -f json                    # JSON output with full metadata\n```\n\nAliases: `list`, `ls`\n\n**`specture status`** — detailed view of one spec, including tasks and current task.\n\n```bash\nspecture status                          # Current in-progress spec\nspecture status --spec 3                 # Specific spec by number\nspecture status -f json                  # JSON output\n```\n\nTypical workflow: run `specture list` to find the spec you need, then `specture status --spec N` to see its tasks and progress.\n\n### specture new\n\nCreate a new spec file with automatic numbering and branch.\n\n```bash\n# Non-interactive: provide title via flag (required for agents)\nspecture new --title \"Feature name\"\n\n# Pipe full body content\ncat spec-body.md | specture new --title \"Feature name\"\n\n# Skip branch creation\nspecture new --title \"Feature name\" --no-branch\n\n# Skip opening editor\nspecture new --title \"Feature name\" --no-editor\n\n# Preview without creating anything\nspecture new --title \"Feature name\" --dry-run\n```\n\nAliases: `new`, `n`, `add`, `a`\n\n### specture validate\n\nValidate that specs follow the Specture System format.\n\n```bash\n# Validate all specs\nspecture validate\n\n# Validate a specific spec by number\nspecture validate --spec 3\nspecture validate -s 42\n```\n\nChecks: valid frontmatter (number and status), no duplicate numbers, description present, task list present. Warns on number/filename mismatch.\n\nAliases: `validate`, `v`\n\n### specture setup\n\nInitialize or update the Specture System in a repository.\n\n```bash\n# Non-interactive setup\nspecture setup --yes\n\n# Preview without changes\nspecture setup --dry-run\n\n# Force AGENTS.md update prompt\nspecture setup --update-agents --yes\n```\n\nAliases: `setup`, `update`, `u`\n\n### specture rename\n\nRename a spec file and update all markdown links in the specs directory.\n\n```bash\n# Rename spec 3 to status-command.md\nspecture rename --spec 3 status-command\n\n# Preview changes\nspecture rename --spec 3 status-command --dry-run\n```\n\n## Spec Status Workflow\n\nSpecs move through these statuses:\n\n1. **draft** — Being written and refined\n2. **approved** — Ready for implementation\n3. **in-progress** — Implementation underway (tasks being checked off)\n4. **completed** — All tasks done\n5. **rejected** — Reviewed and rejected\n\nIf a spec has no explicit `status` in frontmatter, it is inferred from tasks:\n- No task list or no complete tasks → `draft`\n- Mix of complete and incomplete → `in-progress`\n- All tasks complete → `completed`\n\n## Commit Messages\n\nUse conventional commits:\n\n- `feat:` — new features\n- `fix:` — bug fixes\n- `refactor:` — code restructuring\n- `docs:` — documentation\n- `test:` — test changes\n\n## Precedence\n\nHigher-numbered specs take precedence over lower-numbered ones when they conflict. Completed specs are historical records — do not retroactively update them (except to fix typos or factual errors).\n\n## Spec Format Reference\n\nFor detailed spec file format (frontmatter fields, sections, naming conventions), see [references/spec-format.md](references/spec-format.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:15.992Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured spec-driven software architecture capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化规范驱动的软件架构能力的开发Agent。","ja":"仕様駆動のソフトウェアアーキテクチャ機能を必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 사양 중심의 소프트웨어 아키텍처 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan capacidades de arquitectura de software estructurada y basada en especificaciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de capacités d''architecture logicielle structurée et basée sur des spécifications.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die strukturierte, spezifikationsgetriebene Software-Architektur-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de capacidades de arquitetura de software baseada em especificações estruturadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы возможности структурированной спецификации архитектуры программного обеспечения.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الوكلاء التي تحتاج إلى قدرات بنية برمجية منظمة مدفوعة بالمواصفات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage specs using YAML frontmatter, implement design rationales, and track implementation tasks, leveraging spec numbers and filenames for efficient feature development and refactoring.","zh":"使Agent能够使用YAML frontmatter管理规范，实现设计原理，并跟踪实现任务，利用规范编号和文件名进行高效的功能开发和重构。","ja":"仕様番号とファイル名を活用して、効率的な機能開発とリファクタリングを行うために、エージェントがYAML frontmatterを使用して仕様を管理し、設計理論を実装し、実装タスクを追跡することを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 YAML frontmatter를 사용하여 사양을 관리하고, 설계 근거를 구현하며, 구현 작업을 추적할 수 있도록 하여, 사양 번호와 파일 이름을 활용하여 효율적인 기능 개발과 리팩토링을 수행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar especificaciones utilizando YAML frontmatter, implementar razonamientos de diseño e iniciar tareas de implementación, aprovechando números y nombres de archivo de especificaciones para un desarrollo y refactorización de características eficientes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des spécifications en utilisant le YAML frontmatter, de mettre en œuvre des raisonnements de conception et de suivre les tâches de mise en œuvre, en exploitant les numéros et les noms de fichiers de spécifications pour un développement et une refactoring de fonctionnalités efficaces.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Spezifikationen mithilfe von YAML-Frontmatter zu verwalten, Designrationale zu implementieren und Implementierungsaufgaben zu verfolgen, indem Spezifikationsnummern und Dateinamen für eine effiziente Funktionsentwicklung und -refactoring genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar especificações usando frontmatter YAML, implementar razões de design e rastrear tarefas de implementação, utilizando números de especificações e nomes de arquivos para desenvolvimento e refatoração de recursos eficientes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять спецификациями с помощью YAML frontmatter, реализовывать обоснования дизайна и отслеживать задачи реализации, используя номера спецификаций и имена файлов для эффективной разработки и рефакторинга функций.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة المواصفات باستخدام YAML frontmatter، وتنفيذ أساسيات التصميم وتتبع مهام التنفيذ، باستخدام أرقام المواصفات وأسماء الملفات من أجل تطوير ميزات متقنة وإعادة هيكلة فعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating spec document management","Generating implementation task lists from specs","Refactoring codebase using spec-driven redesigns"],"zh":["自动化规范文档管理","从规范生成实现任务列表","使用规范驱动的重新设计重构代码库"],"ja":["仕様ドキュメント管理の自動化","仕様から実装タスクリストの生成","仕様駆動の再設計を使用したコードベースのリファクタリング"],"ko":["사양 문서 관리 자동화","사양에서 구현 작업 목록 생성","사양 중심 재설계를 사용한 코드베이스 리팩토링"],"es":["Automatización de la gestión de documentos de especificaciones","Generación de listas de tareas de implementación a partir de especificaciones","Reestructuración del código utilizando rediseños basados en especificaciones"],"fr":["Automatisation de la gestion de documents de spécifications","Génération de listes de tâches de mise en œuvre à partir de spécifications","Réorganisation du code à l''aide de conceptions basées sur des spécifications"],"de":["Automatisierung der Spezifikationsdokumentenverwaltung","Erzeugung von Implementierungsaufgabenlisten aus Spezifikationen","Neustrukturierung des Codebasys unter Verwendung von spezifikationsgetriebenen Neuentwürfen"],"pt":["Automizar a gestão de documentos de especificações","Gerar listas de tarefas de implementação a partir de especificações","Refatorar a base de código usando redesenho baseado em especificações"],"ru":["Автоматизировать управление документами спецификаций","Генерировать списки задач реализации из спецификаций","Рефакторить кодовую базу с помощью переработки на основе спецификаций"],"ar":["أتمتة إدارة وثائق المواصفات","генерировать قوائم مهام التنفيذ من المواصفات","إعادة هيكلة قاعدة الشفرة باستخدام إعادة التصميم القائمة على المواصفات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specs directory with valid YAML frontmatter","Limited to spec-driven development workflows"],"zh":["需要包含有效YAML frontmatter的specs目录","仅限于规范驱动的工作流程"],"ja":["有効なYAML frontmatterを含む仕様ディレクトリが必要","仕様駆動の開発ワークフローに限定される"],"ko":["유효한 YAML frontmatter가 포함된 specs 디렉토리 필요","사양 중심 개발 워크플로우로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere un directorio de especificaciones con YAML frontmatter válido","Limitado a flujos de trabajo de desarrollo basados en especificaciones"],"fr":["Nécessite un répertoire de spécifications avec un YAML frontmatter valide","Limité aux flux de travail de développement basés sur des spécifications"],"de":["Benötigt ein Spezifikationsverzeichnis mit gültigem YAML-Frontmatter","Begrenzt auf spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklungswerkflüsse"],"pt":["Requer diretório de especificações com frontmatter YAML válido","Limitado a fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento baseado em especificações"],"ru":["Требует директории спецификаций с действительным YAML frontmatter","Ограничен рабочими процессами разработки на основе спецификаций"],"ar":["يتطلب ملفًا من مواصفات مع YAML frontmatter صالح","محدود بتدفقات عمل تطوير مدفوعة بالمواصفات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"6666671a8a4c3f709e755338eb87877811718e5b3e2c762d8c71189dbbfb25a2","qualityScore":42}');
