INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('zotoio/x-fidelity/xfi-create-plan', 'xfi-create-plan', 'zotoio', 'x-fidelity', 'community', 'xfi-create-plan zotoio x-fidelity community The xfi-create-plan skill guides the xfi-planner agent in creating comprehensive engineering plans for complex initiatives, requiring a clear understanding of the feature or initiative and access to the xfi-system-design agent. xfi-create-plan技能用于创建综合工程计划，包括要求收集和子任务委托，使用CLI进行意见化框架检查 xfi-create-planスキルは、要求収集やサブタスクの委任を含む、包括的なエンジニアリングプランを作成するために使用されます xfi-create-plan 스킬은 포괄적인 엔지니어링 계획을 생성하는 데 사용되며, 요구 사항 수집 및 하위 작업 위임을 포함하여 CLI를 사용하여 의견화 프레임워크를 확인합니다 xfi-create-plan es un CLI para la verificación de la adherencia a marcos de trabajo, que ayuda a crear planes de ingeniería completos para iniciativas complejas xfi-create-plan est un CLI pour la vérification de la conformité aux frameworks, qui aide à créer des plans d''ingénierie complets pour des initiatives complexes xfi-create-plan ist ein CLI für die Prüfung von Framework-Richtlinien, das dabei hilft, umfassende Ingenieurpläne für komplexe Initiativen zu erstellen O xfi-create-plan é uma ferramenta de linha de comando que ajuda a garantir a adesão a frameworks, melhorando a eficiência do desenvolvimento. xfi-create-plan - это инструмент командной строки, который помогает обеспечить соблюдение фреймворков, повышая эффективность разработки. xfi-create-plan هو أداة سطر الأوامر تساعد على ضمان الامتثال لآراء الإطار، مما يحسن كفاءة التطوير. how to use xfi-create-plan xfi-create-plan setup guide xfi-create-plan alternative xfi-create-plan vs xfi-system-design xfi-create-plan install what is xfi-create-plan xfi-create-plan tutorial xfi-create-plan engineering plan creation xfi-create-plan requirements gathering xfi-create-plan CLI工程计划 要求收集 子任务委托 xfi-system-design AI工具 工程计划创建 Performs requirements gathering through up to 10 questions Integrates with xfi-system-design agent for architectural input Delegates subtasks to appropriate subagents for efficient planning Guides the xfi-planner agent through comprehensive engineering plan creation Supports complex initiative planning through a structured workflow Utilizes a CLI-based interface for opinionated framework adherence checks xfi-create-plan is a CLI-based skill for opinionated framework adherence checks, enabling the creation of detailed engineering plans through requirements gathering and subtask delegation.');
