AI Development","zh":"创建AI智能代理设置指南","ja":"AIエージェントの作成ベストプラクティス","ko":"AI 에이전트 생성 가이드","es":"Guía de configuración para crear agentes de IA","fr":"Guide de création d''agents d''IA : meilleures pratiques","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für die Erstellung von KI-Agents","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Agente de Aprendizado de Máquina","ru":"Настройка ИИ Агента: Лучшие Практики","ar":"دليل إعداد وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"description":{"en":"Get started with create-agent and streamline your AI development workflow. Learn how to create and register new agents with our step-by-step guide.","zh":"学习创建AI智能代理的步骤，包括目录结构、SKILL.md、agent.py等","ja":"AIエージェントを作成するためのステップバイステップガイド","ko":"AI 에이전트 생성을 위한 체크리스트와 기술 정보","es":"Aprende a crear agentes de IA con nuestra guía paso a paso, incluyendo la estructura de directorios y el registro en el gráfico de flujo de trabajo","fr":"Découvrez comment créer des agents d''IA avec notre guide étape par étape, y compris la structure de répertoire et l''enregistrement dans le graphique de workflow","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie KI-Agents mit unserem Schritt-für-Schritt-Leitfaden erstellen, einschließlich Verzeichnisstruktur und Registrierung im Workflow-Graphen","pt":"Aprenda a criar um agente de aprendizado de máquina com nosso guia passo a passo, incluindo estrutura de diretório e registro","ru":"Создайте ИИ агент с помощью нашего пошагового руководства, включая структуру директории и регистрацию","ar":"تعلم كيفية إنشاء وكيل ذكاء اصطناعي باستخدام دليلنا الخطوة بخطوة، بما في ذلك هيكل الدليل وتسجيله"},"definition":{"en":"create-agent is a skill that provides a structured approach to creating new AI agents, involving steps such as writing agent.py and updating the workflow graph.","zh":"创建AI智能代理是指按照特定步骤和指南创建一个新的AI代理","ja":"AIエージェントの作成とは、特定のステップとガイドに従って新しいAIエージェントを作成すること","ko":"AI 에이전트 생성이란 특정 단계와 가이드에 따라 새로운 AI 에이전트를 생성하는 것","es":"Un agente de IA es un programa que utiliza inteligencia artificial para realizar tareas automáticamente","fr":"Un agent d''IA est un programme qui utilise l''intelligence artificielle pour effectuer des tâches de manière automatique","de":"Ein KI-Agent ist ein Programm, das künstliche Intelligenz verwendet, um Aufgaben automatisch auszuführen","pt":"O create-agent é uma habilidade de aprendizado de máquina que permite criar agentes personalizados","ru":"Create-agent - это навык ИИ, который позволяет создавать пользовательских агентов","ar":"إن create-agent هو مهارة ذكاء اصطناعي يسمح بإنشاء وكلاء مخصصين"},"features":{"en":["Creates directory structure for new agents","Generates SKILL.md files for agent documentation","Writes agent.py files for agent implementation","Registers new agents in src/agents/__init__.py","Updates workflow graph to include new agents","Runs verification to ensure agent correctness"],"zh":["创建目录结构","编写SKILL.md","编写agent.py","注册src/agents/__init__.py","更新路由器","运行验证"],"ja":["ディレクトリ構造の作成","SKILL.mdの書き込み","agent.pyの書き込み","src/agents/__init__.pyへの登録","ルーターの更新","検証の実行"],"ko":["디렉토리 구조 생성","SKILL.md 작성","agent.py 작성","src/agents/__init__.py 등록","라우터 업데이트","검증 실행"],"es":["Estructura de directorios personalizable","Registro en el gráfico de flujo de trabajo","Creación de agentes de IA con Python","Integración con el marco de trabajo de la aplicación","Verificación y depuración del agente","Compatible con entornos de desarrollo de IA"],"fr":["Structure de répertoire personnalisable","Enregistrement dans le graphique de workflow","Création d''agents d''IA avec Python","Intégration avec le framework de l''application","Vérification et débogage de l''agent","Compatible avec les environnements de développement d''IA"],"de":["Anpassbare Verzeichnisstruktur","Registrierung im Workflow-Graphen","Erstellung von KI-Agents mit Python","Integration mit dem Anwendungsframework","Überprüfung und Debugging des Agents","Kompatibel mit KI-Entwicklungsumgebungen"],"pt":["Criação de estrutura de diretório personalizada","Registro do agente no arquivo src/agents/__init__.py","Adição do agente ao gráfico de workflow","Atualização do roteador para incluir o agente","Execução de verificação do agente","Suporte a aprendizado de máquina personalizado"],"ru":["Создание пользовательской структуры директории","Регистрация агента в файле src/agents/__init__.py","Добавление агента в граф рабочего процесса","Обновление роутера для включения агента","Выполнение проверки агента","Поддержка пользовательского ИИ"],"ar":["إنشاء هيكل دليل مخصص","تسجيل الوكيل في ملف src/agents/__init__.py","إضافة الوكيل إلى مخطط سير العمل","تحديث الموجه ليشمل الوكيل","تشغيل التحقق من الوكيل","دعم ذكاء اصطناعي مخصص"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use create-agent","create-agent setup guide","create-agent alternative","create-agent vs agent-tool","create-agent install","what is create-agent","create-agent tutorial","create-agent documentation","create-agent workflow"],"zh":["AI智能代理","创建AI代理","AI代理设置","SKILL.md","agent.py","Python编程","AI开发"],"ja":["AIエージェント","AIエージェントの作成","AIエージェントの設定","SKILL.md","agent.py","Pythonプログラミング","AI開発"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","AI 에이전트 생성","AI 에이전트 설정","SKILL.md","agent.py","Python 프로그래밍","AI 개발"],"es":["crear agente de ia","guía de configuración de agente de ia","desarrollo de agente de ia","agentes de ia en python","registar agente de ia en el gráfico de flujo de trabajo","verificar agente de ia","entornos de desarrollo de ia","herramientas de ia para desarrolladores"],"fr":["créer un agent d''ia","guide de configuration d''agent d''ia","développement d''agent d''ia","agents d''ia en python","enregistrer un agent d''ia dans le graphique de workflow","vérifier un agent d''ia","environnements de développement d''ia","outils d''ia pour les développeurs"],"de":["ki-agent erstellen","einrichtungsleitfaden für ki-agents","entwicklung von ki-agents","ki-agents in python","registrieren von ki-agents im workflow-graphen","überprüfen von ki-agents","entwicklungsumgebungen für ki","ki-tools für entwickler"],"pt":["create-agent","aprendizado de máquina","agentes de aprendizado de máquina","guias de configuração","desenvolvimento de agentes","registro de agentes","gráficos de workflow","roteadores de aprendizado de máquina","verificação de agentes"],"ru":["create-agent","ИИ","ИИ агенты","настройка ИИ агентов","разработка ИИ агентов","регистрация ИИ агентов","графики рабочего процесса","роутеры ИИ","проверка ИИ агентов"],"ar":["create-agent","ذكاء اصطناعي","وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي","دليل إعداد وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تسجيل وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","مخططات سير العمل","موجهات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحقق من وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"zzfancitizen","repo":"agent-skills-self-learning-sample","repoPath":"zzfancitizen/agent-skills-self-learning-sample","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.496Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-agent","description":"Scaffold a new agent in this multi-agent system following the project skeleton. Use when the user wants to create, add, or scaffold a new agent, or asks about adding agents to the workflow.","bodyPreview":"# Create Agent\n\nFollow this checklist when creating a new agent. Replace `<name>` with the\nagent name (lowercase, e.g. `reviewer`) and `<Name>` with the PascalCase class\nname (e.g. `ReviewerAgent`).\n\n```\nProgress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Create directory structure\n- [ ] Step 2: Write SKILL.md\n- [ ] Step 3: Write agent.py\n- [ ] Step 4: Write package __init__.py\n- [ ] Step 5: Register in src/agents/__init__.py\n- [ ] Step 6: Add to workflow graph\n- [ ] Step 7: Update router\n- [ ] Step 8: Run verification\n```","body":"# Create Agent\n\nFollow this checklist when creating a new agent. Replace `<name>` with the\nagent name (lowercase, e.g. `reviewer`) and `<Name>` with the PascalCase class\nname (e.g. `ReviewerAgent`).\n\n```\nProgress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Create directory structure\n- [ ] Step 2: Write SKILL.md\n- [ ] Step 3: Write agent.py\n- [ ] Step 4: Write package __init__.py\n- [ ] Step 5: Register in src/agents/__init__.py\n- [ ] Step 6: Add to workflow graph\n- [ ] Step 7: Update router\n- [ ] Step 8: Run verification\n```\n\n## Step 1: Create directory structure\n\n```\nsrc/agents/<name>/\n├── __init__.py\n├── agent.py\n└── skills/\n    └── <skill_name>/\n        ├── SKILL.md\n        └── tools/          # optional, only if agent needs tools\n            ├── __init__.py\n            └── <tool>.py\n```\n\n## Step 2: Write SKILL.md\n\nCreate `src/agents/<name>/skills/<skill_name>/SKILL.md`:\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: <skill_name>\ndescription: Brief description of what this skill does\ntags: [<tag1>, <tag2>]\n---\n\n# <Skill Title>\n\nDetailed instructions the LLM follows when this skill is loaded...\n```\n\n## Step 3: Write agent.py\n\nCreate `src/agents/<name>/agent.py` following this skeleton:\n\n```python\n\"\"\"\n<Name> Agent - <one-line purpose>\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom langchain_core.messages import BaseMessage, AIMessage\n\nfrom ..base import BaseAgent\nfrom ...skills.registry import SkillRegistry\nfrom ...skills.loader import SkillLoader\n\n\nclass <Name>Agent(BaseAgent):\n    \"\"\"<Name> Agent — <brief description>\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, skill_registry: SkillRegistry, **kwargs):\n        # Discover and register all skills from skills/ subdirectory\n        agent_dir = Path(__file__).parent\n        skills = SkillLoader.load_agent_skills(agent_dir, lazy=skill_registry._lazy)\n        for skill in skills:\n            skill_registry.register(skill)\n\n        super().__init__(skill_registry, **kwargs)\n\n        # If agent has tools, register them here:\n        # from .skills.<skill_name>.tools.<tool_module> import <tool>\n        # self.register_tools([<tool>])\n\n    @property\n    def agent_name(self) -> str:\n        return \"<Name>Agent\"\n\n    @property\n    def default_skills(self) -> list[str]:\n        return [\"<skill_name>\"]\n\n    @property\n    def base_system_prompt(self) -> str:\n        return \"\"\"<system prompt for this agent>\"\"\"\n\n    def process(self, messages: list[BaseMessage], **kwargs) -> dict:\n        response = self.invoke(messages)\n        content = response.content\n        return {\n            \"result\": content,\n            \"raw_response\": response,\n        }\n```\n\n## Step 4: Write package `__init__.py`\n\nCreate `src/agents/<name>/__init__.py`:\n\n```python\n\"\"\"\n<Name> Agent Package\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom .agent import <Name>Agent\n\n__all__ = [\"<Name>Agent\"]\n```\n\n## Step 5: Register in `src/agents/__init__.py`\n\nAdd the import and export:\n\n```python\nfrom .<name> import <Name>Agent\n```\n\nAnd add `\"<Name>Agent\"` to the `__all__` list.\n\n## Step 6: Add to workflow graph\n\nEdit `src/graph/workflow.py`:\n\n1. **Import** the new agent class in the imports section.\n\n2. **Instantiate** it in `create_workflow()` alongside the other agents:\n   ```python\n   <name> = <Name>Agent(skill_registry, **agent_kwargs)\n   ```\n\n3. **Define a node function** following the existing pattern:\n   ```python\n   def <name>_node(state: AgentState) -> dict:\n       input_data = {\"messages\": state[\"messages\"]}\n       result = <name>.process(state[\"messages\"])\n       output = {\n           \"current_agent\": \"<name>\",\n           # map result keys to AgentState fields as needed\n       }\n       _log_agent(\"<Name>Agent\", input_data, output)\n       return output\n   ```\n\n4. **Register the node**:\n   ```python\n   workflow.add_node(\"<name>\", <name>_node)\n   ```\n\n5. **Add edges** — connect the node to the graph with `add_edge` or\n   `add_conditional_edges` depending on the routing logic.\n\n6. If the new agent''s output needs a new state field, add it to\n   `AgentState` in `src/graph/state.py` and to `create_initial_state()`.\n\n## Step 7: Update router\n\nIf the router should be able to route to this new agent:\n\n1. Add the new route to `RouterAgent.VALID_ROUTES` in\n   `src/agents/router/agent.py`.\n\n2. Add the route description to `RouterAgent.base_system_prompt`.\n\n3. Update `src/agents/router/skills/routing/SKILL.md` with a new section\n   describing when to route to this agent.\n\n4. Update `route_decision()` in `src/graph/workflow.py` to handle the\n   new route value.\n\n## Step 8: Run verification\n\nRun the verification skill to confirm nothing is broken:\n\n```bash\nuv run python -c \"import src.main; import src.graph; import src.agents; import src.skills\"\nuv run python -m src.main --test\n```\n\nExpected: \"Workflow created successfully\", correct skill count, \"All tests passed\".\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:10:13.335Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Developer Agents needing streamlined agent creation and registration processes.","zh":"非常适合需要简化代理创建和注册过程的AI开发代理。","ja":"エージェントの作成と登録プロセスを簡素化する必要があるAI開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"에이전트 생성 및 등록 프로세스를 간소화해야 하는 AI 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrolladores de IA que necesitan procesos de creación y registro de agentes optimizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement d''IA nécessitant des processus de création et d''enregistrement d''agents rationalisés.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Entwicklungsagenten, die optimierte Agentenerstellungs- und Registrierungsprozesse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedores de IA que necessitam de processos de criação e registro de agentes simplificados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков ИИ, которым необходимы упрощенные процессы создания и регистрации агентов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل وكلاء développers الإصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى عمليات إنشاء و تسجيل وكلاء مبسطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create new directory structures, write SKILL.md files, and register agents using Python, providing a structured approach to agent development with steps including writing agent.py and updating workflow graphs.","zh":"赋予代理创建新目录结构、编写SKILL.md文件和使用Python注册代理的能力，提供了结构化的代理开发方法，包括编写agent.py和更新工作流图。","ja":"エージェントが新しいディレクトリ構造を作成し、SKILL.mdファイルを書き、Pythonを使用してエージェントを登録する能力を与え、エージェント開発に構造化されたアプローチを提供します。手順には、agent.pyの書き込みとワークフローグラフの更新が含まれます。","ko":"에이전트가 새로운 디렉토리 구조를 생성하고 SKILL.md 파일을 작성하며 Python을 사용하여 에이전트를 등록할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 에이전트 개발에 구조화된 접근 방식을 제공합니다. 단계에는 agent.py를 작성하고 워크플로 그래프를 업데이트하는 것이 포함됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear nuevas estructuras de directorios, escribir archivos SKILL.md y registrar agentes utilizando Python, proporcionando un enfoque estructurado para el desarrollo de agentes con pasos que incluyen escribir agent.py y actualizar gráficos de flujo de trabajo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer de nouvelles structures de répertoires, d''écrire des fichiers SKILL.md et d''enregistrer des agents en utilisant Python, en fournissant une approche structurée du développement d''agents avec des étapes incluant l''écriture de agent.py et la mise à jour des graphiques de flux de travail.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, neue Verzeichnisstrukturen zu erstellen, SKILL.md-Dateien zu schreiben und Agenten mit Python zu registrieren, wodurch ein strukturierter Ansatz für die Agentenentwicklung mit Schritten wie dem Schreiben von agent.py und der Aktualisierung von Workflow-Graphen bereitgestellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar novas estruturas de diretório, escrever arquivos SKILL.md e registrar agentes usando Python, fornecendo uma abordagem estruturada para o desenvolvimento de agentes com etapas incluindo a escrita de agent.py e atualização de gráficos de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать новые структуры каталогов, записывать файлы SKILL.md и регистрировать агентов с помощью Python, обеспечивая структурированный подход к разработке агентов с шагами, включающими написание agent.py и обновление графов рабочих процессов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء هياكل دليل جديدة، وكتابة ملفات SKILL.md، وتسجيل الوكلاء باستخدام Python، مما يوفر نهجًا منظمًا لتطوير الوكيل بخطوات تشمل كتابة agent.py وتحديث رسوم بيانية للعمل."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new AI agents from scratch","Registering custom agents in src/agents/__init__.py","Updating workflow graphs to integrate new agents"],"zh":["从头开始创建新的AI代理","在src/agents/__init__.py中注册自定义代理","更新工作流图以集成新的代理"],"ja":["新しいAIエージェントを作成する","src/agents/__init__.pyにカスタムエージェントを登録する","新しいエージェントを統合するためにワークフローグラフを更新する"],"ko":["새로운 AI 에이전트를 처음부터 생성하는 것","src/agents/__init__.py에 사용자 지정 에이전트를 등록하는 것","新的 에이전트를 통합하기 위해 워크플로 그래프를 업데이트하는 것"],"es":["Crear nuevos agentes de IA desde cero","Registrar agentes personalizados en src/agents/__init__.py","Actualizar gráficos de flujo de trabajo para integrar nuevos agentes"],"fr":["Créer de nouveaux agents d''IA à partir de zéro","Enregistrer des agents personnalisés dans src/agents/__init__.py","Mettre à jour les graphiques de flux de travail pour intégrer de nouveaux agents"],"de":["Erstellen von neuen AI-Agents von Grund auf","Registrieren von benutzerdefinierten Agents in src/agents/__init__.py","Aktualisieren von Workflow-Graphen, um neue Agents zu integrieren"],"pt":["Criar novos agentes de IA do zero","Registrar agentes personalizados em src/agents/__init__.py","Atualizar gráficos de fluxo de trabalho para integrar novos agentes"],"ru":["Создание новых агентов ИИ с нуля","Регистрация пользовательских агентов в src/agents/__init__.py","Обновление графов рабочих процессов для интеграции новых агентов"],"ar":["إنشاء وكلاء إصطناعيين جدد من الصفر","تسجيل وكلاء مخصصين في src/agents/__init__.py","تحديث رسوم بيانية للعمل لتكامل وكلاء جدد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Specific directory structure and file naming conventions must be followed"],"zh":["需要Python环境","必须遵循特定的目录结构和文件命名约定"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","特定のディレクトリ構造とファイル命名規則に従う必要がある"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요합니다.","특정 디렉토리 구조와 파일 이름 규칙을 따라야 합니다."],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Deben seguirse convenciones de estructura de directorios y denominación de archivos específicas"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Des conventions de structure de répertoires et de dénomination de fichiers spécifiques doivent être suivies"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Spezifische Verzeichnisstrukturen und Dateibenennungskonventionen müssen befolgt werden"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Deve-se seguir uma estrutura de diretório específica e convenções de nomenclatura de arquivos"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Необходимо следовать определенной структуре каталогов и соглашениям об именовании файлов"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","يجب اتباع هيكل دليل معين وتوافقية تسمية الملفات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4acde0af0b1643da55b0fc2e9202c851ed36c31a470fb11854768081f8596372","qualityScore":42}');
