 herramienta de análisis de código que ayuda a simplificar y mejorar la calidad del código Python","fr":"Python-simplifier est un outil d''analyse de code qui aide à simplifier et améliorer la qualité du code Python","de":"Python-simplifier ist ein Code-Analyse-Tool, das dabei hilft, die Qualität und Lesbarkeit von Python-Code zu verbessern","pt":"O python-simplifier é uma ferramenta de otimização de código Python","ru":"ИИ Агент python-simplifier - это инструмент для упрощения кода Python","ar":"python-simplifier هو أداة لمساعدة في تحسين código Python"},"features":{"en":["Runs comprehensive analysis using python scripts/analyze_all.py","Analyzes cyclomatic and cognitive complexity with python scripts/analyze_complexity.py","Identifies code smells such as mutable defaults and bare excepts with python scripts/find_code_smells.py","Detects overengineering and YAGNI violations with python scripts/find_overengineering.py","Supports individual analyzers for targeted code improvement"],"zh":["支持复杂性分析","能够检测代码臭味","可以识别过度工程化的代码","提供 CLI 工具用于代码分析","支持多种代码检查"],"ja":["複雑性分析をサポート","コードの臭いを検出可能","過度のエンジニアリングを検出可能","CLI ツールを使用したコード分析を提供","複数のコードチェックをサポート"],"ko":["복잡성 분석 지원","코드 냄새 검출 가능","과도한 엔지니어링 검출 가능","CLI 도구를 사용한 코드 분석 제공","다중 코드 체크 지원"],"es":["Análisis de complejidad cognitiva y ciclomática","Detección de problemas de código como mutabilidad y excepciones no manejadas","Identificación de violaciones de YAGNI y código no utilizado","Ejecución de scripts de análisis individuales para evaluar aspectos específicos del código","Integración con la línea de comandos (CLI) para una ejecución flexible","Compatibilidad con proyectos Python para una amplia gama de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Analyse de la complexité cognitive et cyclomatique","Détection de problèmes de code tels que la mutabilité et les exceptions non gérées","Identification des violations de YAGNI et du code non utilisé","Exécution de scripts d''analyse individuels pour évaluer des aspects spécifiques du code","Intégration avec la ligne de commande (CLI) pour une exécution flexible","Compatibilité avec les projets Python pour une large gamme d''applications"],"de":["Analyse der kognitiven und cyclomativen Komplexität","Erkennung von Codeproblemen wie Mutabilität und unbehandelten Ausnahmen","Identifizierung von YAGNI-Verletzungen und ungenutztem Code","Ausführung von einzelnen Analyse-Skripten zur Bewertung spezifischer Aspekte des Codes","Integration mit der Kommandozeile (CLI) für eine flexible Ausführung","Kompatibilität mit Python-Projekten für eine breite Palette von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Análise de complexidade de código Python","Detecção de cheiros de código (code smells)","Identificação de sobre-engenharia (overengineering)","Suporte a scripts de análise personalizados","Integração com o CLI para execução de comandos"],"ru":["Анализ сложности кода Python","Обнаружение запахов кода (code smells)","Определение переинжиниринга (overengineering)","Поддержка пользовательских скриптов анализа","Интеграция с CLI для выполнения команд"],"ar":["تحليل التعقيد في código Python","اكتشاف روائح الكود (code smells)","تحديد التهجين الزائد (overengineering)","دعم البرامج النصية التحليلية المخصصة","التكامل مع CLI لتنفيذ الأوامر"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use python-simplifier","python-simplifier setup guide","python code simplification","python-simplifier alternative","python-simplifier vs telluriumgames","python code analysis","python code readability","python-simplifier install","simplifying complex python code"],"zh":["python-simplifier","Python 代码简化","代码可读性","代码维护性","复杂性分析","代码臭味","过度工程化"],"ja":["python-simplifier","Python コード簡素化","コードの可読性","コードの保守性","複雑性分析","コードの臭い","過度のエンジニアリング"],"ko":["python-simplifier","Python 코드 단순화","코드 가독성","코드 유지보수성","복잡성 분석","코드 냄새","과도한 엔지니어링"],"es":["python-simplifier","análisis de código python","mejora de código","herramientas de desarrollo python","optimización de código","detección de problemas de código","YAGNI","ciclomática","complejidad cognitiva","python"],"fr":["python-simplifier","analyse de code python","amélioration de code","outils de développement python","optimisation de code","détection de problèmes de code","YAGNI","cyclomatique","complexité cognitive","python"],"de":["python-simplifier","code-analyse python","code-optimierung","entwicklungstools python","fehlererkennung","YAGNI","cyclomatich","kognitive komplexität","python"],"pt":["python simplifier","otimização de código python","análise de complexidade","code smells","overengineering","CLI python","ferramentas de desenvolvimento python"],"ru":["ИИ Агент python","упрощение кода python","анализ сложности","code smells","переинжиниринг","CLI python","инструменты разработки python"],"ar":["مبسط بايثون","تحسين código python","تحليل التعقيد","روائح الكود","التهجين الزائد","CLI بايثون","أدوات تطوير بايثون"]}},"owner":"charlesmsiegel","repo":"tg","repoPath":"charlesmsiegel/tg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.501Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"python-simplifier","description":"Simplify overly complex Python code. Use when user asks to simplify, refactor, clean up, make more readable, reduce complexity, improve code quality, find code smells, detect duplicates, or analyze coupling in Python code. Triggers on requests like simplify this code, this is too complex, make this more readable, refactor this, clean this up, find issues, analyze this codebase, or when reviewing code that exhibits complexity anti-patterns. For Django-specific analysis, use the django-simplifier skill instead.","bodyPreview":"# Python Code Simplifier\n\nTransform complex, hard-to-maintain Python code into clean, readable, idiomatic solutions.\n\n## Analysis Scripts\n\n```bash\n# Comprehensive analysis (runs all checks)\npython scripts/analyze_all.py /path/to/project\n\n# Individual analyzers:\npython scripts/analyze_complexity.py .       # Cyclomatic/cognitive complexity\npython scripts/find_code_smells.py .         # Mutable defaults, bare excepts, etc.\npython scripts/find_overengineering.py .     # YAGNI violations, unused abs","body":"# Python Code Simplifier\n\nTransform complex, hard-to-maintain Python code into clean, readable, idiomatic solutions.\n\n## Analysis Scripts\n\n```bash\n# Comprehensive analysis (runs all checks)\npython scripts/analyze_all.py /path/to/project\n\n# Individual analyzers:\npython scripts/analyze_complexity.py .       # Cyclomatic/cognitive complexity\npython scripts/find_code_smells.py .         # Mutable defaults, bare excepts, etc.\npython scripts/find_overengineering.py .     # YAGNI violations, unused abstractions\npython scripts/find_dead_code.py .           # Unused imports, functions, variables\npython scripts/find_unpythonic.py .          # Non-idiomatic patterns\npython scripts/find_coupling_issues.py .     # Feature envy, low cohesion\npython scripts/find_duplicates.py .          # Structural duplicate detection\n\n# JSON output for CI/tooling\npython scripts/analyze_all.py . --format json > report.json\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze**: Run `analyze_all.py` to identify all issues\n2. **Prioritize**: Address high-severity issues (🔴) first\n3. **Simplify**: Apply patterns below incrementally\n4. **Verify**: Ensure simplified code is functionally equivalent\n\n## Simplification Principles\n\n1. **YAGNI**: Don''t add abstractions until needed\n2. **Preserve behavior**: Simplification ≠ changing functionality\n3. **One change at a time**: Incremental is safer\n4. **Readability over cleverness**: Clear beats \"smart\"\n5. **Keep related code together**: Locality matters\n\n## Common Simplification Patterns\n\n### Extract and Name\n\n```python\n# Before: Complex inline condition\nif user.age >= 18 and user.country in ALLOWED and not user.banned:\n\n# After: Named condition\nis_eligible = user.age >= 18 and user.country in ALLOWED and not user.banned\nif is_eligible:\n```\n\n### Early Returns\n\n```python\n# Before: Deep nesting\ndef process(data):\n    if data:\n        if data.valid:\n            if data.ready:\n                return compute(data)\n    return None\n\n# After: Guard clauses\ndef process(data):\n    if not data or not data.valid or not data.ready:\n        return None\n    return compute(data)\n```\n\n### Comprehensions\n\n```python\n# Before: Manual loop\nresult = []\nfor item in items:\n    if item.active:\n        result.append(item.name)\n\n# After: List comprehension\nresult = [item.name for item in items if item.active]\n```\n\n### Dictionary Techniques\n\n```python\n# Before: Verbose key checking\nif key in d:\n    value = d[key]\nelse:\n    value = default\n\n# After: get() with default\nvalue = d.get(key, default)\n\n# Before: Manual grouping\ngroups = {}\nfor item in items:\n    if item.category not in groups:\n        groups[item.category] = []\n    groups[item.category].append(item)\n\n# After: defaultdict\nfrom collections import defaultdict\ngroups = defaultdict(list)\nfor item in items:\n    groups[item.category].append(item)\n```\n\n### Context Managers\n\n```python\n# Before: Manual cleanup\nf = open(''file.txt'')\ntry:\n    data = f.read()\nfinally:\n    f.close()\n\n# After: with statement\nwith open(''file.txt'') as f:\n    data = f.read()\n```\n\n## Over-Engineering Anti-Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Problem | Solution |\n|---------|---------|----------|\n| Single-impl interface | Abstract class with one subclass | Merge or wait for need |\n| Unnecessary factory | Factory that creates one type | Direct instantiation |\n| Premature strategy | Strategy pattern with one strategy | Simple function |\n| Thin wrapper | Class that just delegates | Use wrapped class directly |\n| Speculative generality | Code for \"future needs\" | Delete it (YAGNI) |\n| Deep inheritance | 4+ levels of inheritance | Composition over inheritance |\n\n## Code Smells Quick Reference\n\n| Smell | Detection | Fix |\n|-------|-----------|-----|\n| Mutable default | `def f(x=[])` | Use `None`, create inside |\n| Bare except | `except:` | `except Exception:` |\n| God class | 15+ methods, 10+ attrs | Split into focused classes |\n| Long function | 50+ lines | Extract helper functions |\n| Deep nesting | 4+ levels | Early returns, extract |\n| Feature envy | Method uses other class more | Move method |\n| Magic numbers | Unexplained numeric literals | Named constants |\n\n## Script Reference\n\n| Script | What It Detects |\n|--------|-----------------|\n| `analyze_complexity.py` | Cyclomatic complexity, cognitive complexity, nesting depth, function length, parameter count, class size |\n| `find_code_smells.py` | Mutable defaults, bare excepts, magic numbers, type comparisons, god classes, data classes, boolean blindness |\n| `find_overengineering.py` | Single-implementation interfaces, unused abstractions, unnecessary factories/builders, thin wrappers, premature strategies |\n| `find_dead_code.py` | Unused imports, unused functions/classes, unused parameters, unreachable code, constant conditions |\n| `find_unpythonic.py` | `range(len())`, `== True/False/None`, swallowed exceptions, manual index tracking |\n| `find_coupling_issues.py` | Feature envy, low cohesion (LCOM), message chains, middle man classes |\n| `find_duplicates.py` | Structurally similar code blocks using AST normalization |\n\n## When NOT to Simplify\n\n- Working legacy code with no tests\n- Performance-critical hot paths (measure first)\n- Code that will be replaced soon\n- External API constraints requiring complexity\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:10:18.611Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Optimization Agents needing advanced Python code simplification and analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Python代码简化和分析能力的代码优化代理。","ja":"Pythonコードの高度な簡素化および分析機能が必要なコード最適化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Python 코드 단순화 및 분석 기능이 필요한 코드 최적화 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de código que necesitan una simplificación y análisis de código Python avanzados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation de code nécessitant une simplification et une analyse de code Python avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Optimierungsagenten, die eine erweiterte Vereinfachung und Analyse von Python-Code benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de Código que precisam de capacidades avançadas de simplificação e análise de código Python.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации кода, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности упрощения и анализа кода Python.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحسين الكود الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتبسيط وتحليل شفرة بايثون."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform complex Python code into clean, readable, idiomatic solutions using cyclomatic complexity analysis, code smell detection, and overengineering identification through scripts like analyze_all.py, analyze_complexity.py, and find_code_smells.py.","zh":"赋予代理转换复杂Python代码为干净、可读、惯用的解决方案的能力，使用环复杂度分析、代码异味检测和过度工程化识别，通过脚本如analyze_all.py、analyze_complexity.py和find_code_smells.py。","ja":"複雑なPythonコードをクリーンで読みやすいアイディオマティックな解決策に変換するエージェントの能力を与え、サイクロマチック複雑度分析、コードスメル検出、およびオーバーエンジニアリング識別を使用し、analyze_all.py、analyze_complexity.py、find_code_smells.pyなどのスクリプトを介して。","ko":"복잡한 Python 코드를 깨끗하고 읽기 쉬운 관용적인 해결책으로 변환할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, 사이클로매트릭 복잡도 분석, 코드 냄새檢出 및 과도한 엔지니어링 식별을 사용하여 analyze_all.py, analyze_complexity.py 및 find_code_smells.py와 같은 스크립트를 통해 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar código Python complejo en soluciones limpias, legibles e idiomáticas utilizando análisis de complejidad ciclomática, detección de olores de código y identificación de sobreen Ingeniería a través de scripts como analyze_all.py, analyze_complexity.py y find_code_smells.py.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer du code Python complexe en des solutions propres, lisibles et idiomatiques en utilisant l''analyse de complexité cyclomatique, la détection d''odeurs de code et l''identification de sur-ingénierie via des scripts tels que analyze_all.py, analyze_complexity.py et find_code_smells.py.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplexen Python-Code in saubere, lesbare, idiomatische Lösungen zu transformieren, indem sie eine Analyse der cyclischen Komplexität, Code-Geruchserkennung und Über-Engineering-Erkennung durch Skripte wie analyze_all.py, analyze_complexity.py und find_code_smells.py verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar códigos Python complexos em soluções limpas, legíveis, idiomáticas usando análise de complexidade ciclomática, detecção de odores de código e identificação de sobre-engenharia por meio de scripts como analyze_all.py, analyze_complexity.py e find_code_smells.py.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать сложный код Python в чистые, читаемые, идиоматические решения с помощью анализа цикломатической сложности, обнаружения запахов кода и выявления переинжиниринга с помощью скриптов như analyze_all.py, analyze_complexity.py и find_code_smells.py.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحويل شفرات بايثون المعقدة إلى حلول نظيفة وقابلة للقراءة ومتوافقة مع اللغة باستخدام تحليل التعقيد الدوري والكشف عن روائح الكود وتحديد التهجين الزائد من خلال سكريبتات مثل analyze_all.py و analyze_complexity.py و find_code_smells.py."},"useCases":{"en":["Simplifying hard-to-maintain Python codebases","Analyzing cyclomatic and cognitive complexity in Python projects","Identifying and removing code smells like mutable defaults and bare excepts"],"zh":["简化难以维护的Python代码库","分析Python项目的环复杂度和认知复杂度","识别和删除代码异味，如可变默认值和裸except"],"ja":["メンテナンスが困難なPythonコードベースを簡素化する","Pythonプロジェクトのサイクロマチック複雑度と認知複雑度を分析する","可変デフォルトや裸のexceptなどのコードスメルを識別および削除する"],"ko":["유지 보수가 어려운 Python 코드베이스 단순화","Python 프로젝트의 사이클로매트릭 복잡도 및 인지 복잡도 분석","가변 기본값 및裸 except와 같은 코드 냄새 식별 및 제거"],"es":["Simplificar bases de código Python difíciles de mantener","Analizar la complejidad ciclomática y cognitiva en proyectos Python","Identificar y eliminar olores de código como predeterminados mutables y excepciones desnudas"],"fr":["Simplifier les bases de code Python difficiles à maintenir","Analyser la complexité cyclomatique et cognitive dans les projets Python","Identifier et supprimer les odeurs de code comme les valeurs par défaut mutables et les exceptions nues"],"de":["Vereinfachen von schwer zu wartenden Python-Codebasen","Analysieren der cyclischen und kognitiven Komplexität in Python-Projekten","Identifizieren und Entfernen von Code-Gerüchen wie veränderbaren Standardwerten und nackten Ausnahmen"],"pt":["Simplificar bases de código Python de manutenção difícil","Analizar complexidade ciclomática e cognitiva em projetos Python","Identificar e remover odores de código como padrões mutáveis e exceções nuas"],"ru":["Упрощать трудные для поддержки базы кода Python","Анализировать цикломатическую и когнитивную сложность в проектах Python","Выявлять и удалять запахи кода, такие как изменяемые значения по умолчанию и голые исключения"],"ar":["تبسيط قواعد شفرة بايثون الصعبة في الصيانة","تحليل التعقيد الدوري والتعقيد المعرفي في مشاريع بايثون","تحديد وإزالة روائح الكود مثل القيم القابلة للتعديل والاستثناءات النقية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Limited to Python code analysis","Needs access to project directory for analysis"],"zh":["需要Python环境","仅限Python代码分析","需要访问项目目录以进行分析"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","Pythonコードの分析のみ","分析のためにプロジェクトディレクトリへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["Python 환경 필요","Python 코드 분석만 가능","분석을 위해 프로젝트 디렉토리에 액세스해야 함"],"es":["Requiere un entorno Python","Limitado al análisis de código Python","Necesita acceso al directorio del proyecto para el análisis"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Limité à l''analyse de code Python","Nécessite un accès au répertoire du projet pour l''analyse"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Analyse von Python-Code","Benötigt Zugriff auf das Projektverzeichnis für die Analyse"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Limitado à análise de código Python","Necessita acesso ao diretório do projeto para análise"],"ru":["Требует среды Python","Ограничен анализом кода Python","Требует доступа к каталогу проекта для анализа"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون","محدود بتحليل شفرة بايثون","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى دليل المشروع للتحليل"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"b49df2fc820a27aacbbca7669c058d7efd4387161545999c87e82dc346c31737","qualityScore":42}');
