INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('charlesmsiegel/tg/python-simplifier', 'python-simplifier', 'charlesmsiegel', 'tg', 'community', 'python-simplifier charlesmsiegel tg community The python-simplifier skill simplifies complex Python code for developers, making it more maintainable and readable. It provides analysis scripts to identify areas for improvement python-simplifier 是一个 Python 代码简化工具，能够将复杂的代码转换为清晰、可读的代码 python-simplifier は Python コード簡素化ツールで、複雑なコードをクリーンで可読なコードに変換します python-simplifier는 Python 코드 단순화 도구로 복잡한 코드를 깨끗하고 읽기 쉬운 코드로 변환합니다 Python-simplifier es una herramienta que ayuda a transformar código Python complejo en soluciones limpias y mantenibles. Ofrece scripts de análisis para evaluar la complejidad y detectar problemas de código Python-simplifier est un outil qui aide à transformer du code Python complexe en solutions propres et maintenables. Il propose des scripts d''analyse pour évaluer la complexité et détecter les problèmes de code Python-simplifier ist ein Tool, das dabei hilft, komplexen Python-Code in saubere und wartbare Lösungen umzuwandeln. Es bietet Analyse-Skripte, um die Komplexität zu bewerten und Codeprobleme zu erkennen O python-simplifier é uma ferramenta que ajuda a transformar código Python complexo em soluções limpas e legíveis ИИ Агент python-simplifier - это инструмент, который помогает упростить сложный код Python python-simplifier هو أداة تساعد على تحويل código Python المعقد إلى حلول نظيفة وقابلة للقراءة how to use python-simplifier python-simplifier setup guide python code simplification python-simplifier alternative python-simplifier vs telluriumgames python code analysis python code readability python-simplifier install simplifying complex python code python-simplifier Python 代码简化 代码可读性 代码维护性 复杂性分析 代码臭味 过度工程化 Runs comprehensive analysis using python scripts/analyze_all.py Analyzes cyclomatic and cognitive complexity with python scripts/analyze_complexity.py Identifies code smells such as mutable defaults and bare excepts with python scripts/find_code_smells.py Detects overengineering and YAGNI violations with python scripts/find_overengineering.py Supports individual analyzers for targeted code improvement python-simplifier is a minimal version of telluriumgames that runs games and transforms complex Python code into clean, readable solutions');
