トの設定ガイド：agentic-jumpstart-architecture","ko":"AI 에이전트 개발 가이드: agentic-jumpstart-architecture 설정","es":"Guía de Arquitectura para Agentic Jumpstart","fr":"Guide d''Architecture pour Agentic Jumpstart","de":"Architektur-Leitfaden für Agentic Jumpstart","pt":"Guia de Arquitetura Agentic-Jumpstart para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Руководство по архитектуре Agentic-Jumpstart для разработ...","ar":"دليل هندسة Agentic-Jumpstart للـ AI Tools"},"description":{"en":"Discover how to provision development environments with agentic-jumpstart-architecture. Learn to use Jarvy CLI and native package managers for efficient setup","zh":"了解agentic-jumpstart-architecture的技术细节，包括Jarvy CLI项目的目录结构和配置文件","ja":"agentic-jumpstart-architectureの技術的詳細を学び、Jarvy CLIプロジェクトのディレクトリ構造と設定ファイルを理解する","ko":"agentic-jumpstart-architecture의 기술적인 세부 사항을 알아보고, Jarvy CLI 프로젝트의 디렉토리 구조와 설정 파일을 이해하세요","es":"Descubre cómo configurar la arquitectura de Agentic Jumpstart con nuestra guía paso a paso para desarrolladores","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer l''architecture d''Agentic Jumpstart avec notre guide étape par étape pour les développeurs","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die Architektur von Agentic Jumpstart mit unserem Schritt-für-Schritt-Leitfaden für Entwickler konfigurieren","pt":"Aprenda a configurar a arquitetura Agentic-Jumpstart para provisionar ambientes de desenvolvimento com o Jarvy CLI e gerenciamento de pacotes nativos.","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить архитектуру Agentic-Jumpstart для обеспечения среды разработки с помощью Jarvy CLI и управления родными пакетами для ИИ Агентов.","ar":"تعرف على كيفية配置 هندسة Agentic-Jumpstart لتوفير بيئات التطوير باستخدام Jarvy CLI وإدارة الحزم الأصلية لـ AI Tools."},"definition":{"en":"agentic-jumpstart-architecture is a skill that offers guidelines for the Jarvy CLI project, including directory structure and native package manager integration","zh":"agentic-jumpstart-architecture是一种AI开发工具，提供Jarvy CLI项目的架构指导","ja":"agentic-jumpstart-architectureは、Jarvy CLIプロジェクトのアーキテクチャガイ