thub-release는 GitHub Releases에 새로운 버전을 배포하는 명령줄 도구로 오프라인 및 비공개 배포를 지원합니다","es":"github-release es una herramienta de línea de comandos para publicar versiones de software en GitHub","fr":"github-release est un outil en ligne de commande pour publier des versions de logiciels sur GitHub","de":"github-release ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool zur Veröffentlichung von Software-Versionen auf GitHub","pt":"O github-release é uma ferramenta de publicação de versões que utiliza o CLI gh e create-dmg para criar DMG","ru":"github-release — это инструмент публикации версий, использующий CLI gh и create-dmg для создания DMG","ar":"github-release هو أداة نشر إصدارات تستخدم CLI gh و create-dmg لإنشاء DMG"},"features":{"en":["Utilizes the gh CLI for GitHub authentication and release management","Leverages create-dmg for generating DMG attachments","Requires Xcode Command Line Tools for development","Parses target version from user requests for automated release","Strips the v prefix for version strings used in code"],"zh":["支持DMG附件","需要gh CLI、create-dmg和Xcode Command Line Tools","支持解析目标版本","支持strip v prefix","支持保持v prefix用于git tags"],"ja":["DMGアタッチメントをサポート","gh CLI、create-dmg、Xcode Command Line Toolsが必要","ターゲットバージョンの解析をサポート","v prefixの削除をサポート","v prefixを保持してgit tagsを使用"],"ko":["DMG附件 지원","gh CLI, create-dmg 및 Xcode Command Line Tools 필요","대상 버전 파싱 지원","v prefix 제거 지원","v prefix를 유지하여 git 태그 사용"],"es":["Uso de gh CLI para la autenticación","Creación de archivos DMG con create-dmg","Publicación de versiones en GitHub","Soporte para versiones con prefijo ''v''","Requisito de directorio de trabajo limpio","Uso de Xcode Command Line Tools"],"fr":["Utilisation de gh CLI pour l''authentification","Création de fichiers DMG avec create-dmg","Publication de versions sur GitHub","Prise en charge des versions avec préfixe ''v''","Exigence d''un répertoire de travail propre","Utilisation de Xcode Command Line Tools"],"de":["Verwendung von gh CLI für die Authentifizierung","Erstellung von DMG-Dateien mit create-dmg","Veröffentlichung von Versionen auf GitHub","Unterstützung für Versionen mit ''v''-Präfix","Anforderung an ein sauberes Arbeitsverzeichnis","Verwendung von Xcode Command Line Tools"],"pt":["Publicação de novas versões do TransFlow no GitHub","Criação de DMG com o create-dmg","Utilização do CLI gh para autenticação","Suporte a Xcode Command Line Tools","Trabalho com diretórios limpos e sem alterações não commitadas"],"ru":["Публикация новых версий TransFlow на GitHub","Создание DMG с помощью create-dmg","Использование CLI gh для аутентификации","Поддержка Xcode Command Line Tools","Работа с чистыми директориями и без не зафиксированных изменений"],"ar":["نشر إصدارات جديدة من TransFlow على GitHub","إنشاء DMG باستخدام create-dmg","استخدام CLI gh للتحقق","دعم أدوات سطر الأوامر Xcode","العمل مع الدلائل النظيفة وبدون تعديلات غير مرفوعة"]},"keywords":{"en":["github-release setup guide","how to use github-release","github-release alternative","github-release vs git-flow","github-release install","automated github release","transflow version management","github release workflow"],"zh":["github-release","AI工具","发布新版本","gh CLI","create-dmg","Xcode Command Line Tools","DMG附件","命令行工具"],"ja":["github-release","AIエージェント","新しいバージョンの公開","gh CLI","create-dmg","Xcode Command Line Tools","DMGアタッチメント","コマンドラインツール"],"ko":["github-release","AI 도구","新的 버전 배포","gh CLI","create-dmg","Xcode Command Line Tools","DMG附件","명령줄 도구"],"es":["github-release","publicar versiones en GitHub","attachments DMG","gh CLI","create-dmg","TransFlow","herramientas de desarrollo","Herramientas de línea de comandos","github-release configuración"],"fr":["github-release","publier des versions sur GitHub","attachments DMG","gh CLI","create-dmg","TransFlow","outils de développement","Outils en ligne de commande","configuration de github-release"],"de":["github-release","Versionen auf GitHub veröffentlichen","DMG-Anhänge","gh CLI","create-dmg","TransFlow","Entwickler-Tools","Kommandozeilen-Tools","Einrichtung von github-release"],"pt":["github-release","publicação de versões","CLI gh","create-dmg","Xcode Command Line Tools","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["github-release","публикация версий","CLI gh","create-dmg","Xcode Command Line Tools","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["github-release","نشر الإصدارات","CLI gh","create-dmg","أدوات سطر الأوامر Xcode","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Cyronlee","repo":"TransFlow","repoPath":"Cyronlee/TransFlow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.588Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-release","description":"Publish a new GitHub Release for TransFlow with version bump, release notes, DMG build, and gh CLI. Use when the user asks to release a version, publish a release, create a GitHub release, or mentions 发布 vX.Y.Z.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Release\n\nPublish a new TransFlow version to GitHub Releases with DMG attachment.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `gh` CLI installed and authenticated (`gh auth status`)\n- `create-dmg` installed (`brew install create-dmg`)\n- Xcode Command Line Tools\n- Working directory clean (no uncommitted changes unrelated to release)\n\n## Workflow\n\nParse the target version from the user''s request (e.g. \"发布 v1.2.0\" → `1.2.0`). Strip the `v` prefix for version strings used in code; keep `v` prefix for git tags.\n\n``","body":"# GitHub Release\n\nPublish a new TransFlow version to GitHub Releases with DMG attachment.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `gh` CLI installed and authenticated (`gh auth status`)\n- `create-dmg` installed (`brew install create-dmg`)\n- Xcode Command Line Tools\n- Working directory clean (no uncommitted changes unrelated to release)\n\n## Workflow\n\nParse the target version from the user''s request (e.g. \"发布 v1.2.0\" → `1.2.0`). Strip the `v` prefix for version strings used in code; keep `v` prefix for git tags.\n\n```\nTask Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Pre-flight checks\n- [ ] Step 2: Update version numbers\n- [ ] Step 3: Generate release notes\n- [ ] Step 4: Commit, tag, push\n- [ ] Step 5: Build DMG locally\n- [ ] Step 6: Create GitHub Release with DMG\n- [ ] Step 7: Verify release\n```\n\n### Step 1: Pre-flight checks\n\nRun in parallel:\n- `gh auth status` — confirm GitHub CLI is authenticated\n- `git status` — confirm working directory is clean (or only has expected changes)\n- `git log --oneline -20` — review recent commits for release notes\n\n### Step 2: Update version numbers\n\nUpdate `MARKETING_VERSION` in **all 6 locations** inside `project.pbxproj`:\n\n```bash\n# File: TransFlow/TransFlow.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj\n# Replace all occurrences:\nMARKETING_VERSION = <old>;  →  MARKETING_VERSION = <new>;\n```\n\nUpdate fallback version strings in Swift source:\n\n| File | What to change |\n|------|----------------|\n| `TransFlow/TransFlow/Models/JSONLModels.swift` | `?? \"X.Y.Z\"` fallback in `init` |\n| `TransFlow/TransFlow/Views/SettingsView.swift` | `?? \"X.Y.Z\"` fallback in `appVersionString` |\n\n### Step 3: Generate release notes\n\nCreate `release-notes/vX.Y.Z.md` based on `git log` since the last tag (or all commits if first release).\n\n> **Convention**: All release notes live in the `release-notes/` directory at the repo root, named `v<version>.md` (e.g. `release-notes/v1.0.0.md`).\n\nRelease notes template:\n\n```markdown\n# TransFlow vX.Y.Z\n\n[One-line summary of this release]\n\n## What''s New\n- Feature 1\n- Feature 2\n\n## Improvements\n- Improvement 1\n\n## Bug Fixes\n- Fix 1 (if any)\n\n## System Requirements\n- macOS 15.0 or later\n- Apple Silicon (arm64) or Intel (x86_64)\n```\n\nIf there is a previous tag, use `git log <prev-tag>..HEAD --oneline` to scope changes.\n\n### Step 4: Commit, tag, push\n\n```bash\ngit add -A\ngit commit -m \"release: bump version to vX.Y.Z\"\ngit tag -a vX.Y.Z -m \"TransFlow vX.Y.Z\"\ngit push origin main --tags\n```\n\n### Step 5: Build DMG locally\n\n```bash\n./scripts/build-dmg.sh --clean --sign\n```\n\n- `--sign` auto-detects signing identity and auto-loads project entitlements (microphone, etc.)\n- The build disables Xcode signing; the script handles signing separately for consistency\n- Signing identity: `5JNN9A6Z6X`, Team ID: `8RQVLSP2SC`\n- Set `block_until_ms` to 300000 (5 min) — build + DMG takes time\n- Output: `build/TransFlow-X.Y.Z.dmg`\n- Verify the DMG file exists and is non-empty before proceeding\n\n### Step 6: Create GitHub Release\n\n```bash\ngh release create vX.Y.Z \\\n  --title \"TransFlow vX.Y.Z\" \\\n  --notes-file release-notes/vX.Y.Z.md \\\n  ./build/TransFlow-X.Y.Z.dmg\n```\n\n### Step 7: Verify release\n\n```bash\ngh release view vX.Y.Z\n```\n\nConfirm:\n- Title and tag are correct\n- `draft: false`, `prerelease: false`\n- DMG asset is listed with non-zero size\n- Release notes render correctly\n\nReport the release URL to the user.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Action |\n|-------|--------|\n| `gh auth` fails | Ask user to run `gh auth login` |\n| `xcodebuild` fails | Check build errors, fix, retry |\n| `create-dmg` exit code ≠ 0 and ≠ 2 | Check script output for details |\n| `gh release create` fails | Check if tag already has a release; use `gh release delete vX.Y.Z` then retry |\n| DMG file missing after build | Check `build/` directory; re-run build script |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:58.639Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Release Management Agents needing automated GitHub Releases with DMG attachments","zh":"适合需要自动化 GitHub 发布带有 DMG 附件的 Release Management Agents","ja":"GitHub リリースに DMG アタッチメントを自動化する Release Management エージェントに最適","ko":"DMG附件이 포함된 GitHub 릴리스를 자동화하는 릴리스 관리 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de administración de versiones que necesitan versiones automatizadas de GitHub con adjuntos DMG","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de versions ayant besoin de versions GitHub automatisées avec des pièces jointes DMG","de":"Ideal für Release-Management-Agents, die automatisierte GitHub-Veröffentlichungen mit DMG-Anhängen benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Lançamento que necessitam de lançamentos automatizados do GitHub com anexos DMG","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления выпусками, которым необходимы автоматические выпуски GitHub с вложениями DMG","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة الإصدار الذين يحتاجون إلى إصدارات GitHub الآلية مع مرفقات DMG"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to publish new TransFlow versions to GitHub Releases with DMG attachments using the `gh` CLI and `create-dmg` tools, streamlining release management with Xcode Command Line Tools and git tags","zh":"赋予代理发布新 TransFlow 版本到 GitHub 发布带有 DMG 附件的功能，使用 `gh` CLI 和 `create-dmg` 工具，简化使用 Xcode 命令行工具和 git 标签的发布管理","ja":"`gh` CLI と `create-dmg` ツールを使用して、GitHub リリースに DMG アタッチメントを含む新しい TransFlow バージョンを公開するエージェントを強化し、Xcode コマンドラインツールと git タグを使用したリリース管理を簡素化","ko":"`gh` CLI 및 `create-dmg` 도구를 사용하여 DMG附件이 포함된 GitHub 릴리스에 새로운 TransFlow 버전을 게시하도록 에이전트를 활성화하고, Xcode 명령줄 도구 및 git 태그를 사용한 릴리스 관리를 간소화","es":"Habilita a los agentes a publicar nuevas versiones de TransFlow en GitHub Releases con adjuntos DMG utilizando la CLI `gh` y las herramientas `create-dmg`, simplificando la administración de versiones con Xcode Command Line Tools y etiquetas git","fr":"Permet aux agents de publier de nouvelles versions de TransFlow sur GitHub Releases avec des pièces jointes DMG en utilisant la CLI `gh` et les outils `create-dmg`, rationalisant la gestion des versions avec Xcode Command Line Tools et les balises git","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, neue TransFlow-Versionen auf GitHub Releases mit DMG-Anhängen zu veröffentlichen, indem sie die `gh`-CLI und die `create-dmg`-Tools verwenden, wodurch die Release-Verwaltung mit Xcode Command Line Tools und git-Tags rationalisiert wird","pt":"Permite que os agentes publiquem novas versões do TransFlow para os lançamentos do GitHub com anexos DMG usando a CLI `gh` e as ferramentas `create-dmg`, simplificando o gerenciamento de lançamento com as Ferramentas de Linha de Comando do Xcode e tags git","ru":"Позволяет агентам публиковать новые версии TransFlow в выпуски GitHub с вложениями DMG, используя CLI `gh` и инструменты `create-dmg`, оптимизируя управление выпусками с помощью инструментов командной строки Xcode и тегов git","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من نشر إصدارات جديدة من TransFlow إلى إصدارات GitHub مع مرفقات DMG باستخدام CLI `gh` وأدوات `create-dmg`، وبذلك يبسّط إدارة الإصدار مع أدوات سطر الأوامر Xcode وبيانات تعريف git"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating TransFlow version releases to GitHub","Generating DMG attachments for GitHub Releases","Parsing target versions from user requests for efficient release management"],"zh":["自动化 TransFlow 版本发布到 GitHub","为 GitHub 发布生成 DMG 附件","从用户请求中解析目标版本以实现高效的发布管理"],"ja":["TransFlow バージョンを GitHub に自動公開","GitHub リリース用の DMG アタッチメントを生成","ユーザー要求からターゲットバージョンを解析して効率的なリリース管理を実現"],"ko":["TransFlow 버전을 GitHub에 자동으로 릴리스","GitHub 릴리스를 위한 DMG附件 생성","사용자 요청에서 대상 버전을 파싱하여 효율적인 릴리스 관리"],"es":["Automatización de versiones de TransFlow en GitHub","Generación de adjuntos DMG para GitHub Releases","Análisis de versiones objetivo desde solicitudes de usuario para una administración de versiones eficiente"],"fr":["Automatisation des versions TransFlow sur GitHub","Génération de pièces jointes DMG pour les publications GitHub","Analyse des versions cibles à partir des demandes des utilisateurs pour une gestion des versions efficace"],"de":["Automatisierung von TransFlow-Versionen auf GitHub","Erzeugung von DMG-Anhängen für GitHub-Veröffentlichungen","Analyse der Zielversionen aus Benutzeranfragen für eine effiziente Release-Verwaltung"],"pt":["Automatizar lançamentos de versões do TransFlow para o GitHub","Gerar anexos DMG para lançamentos do GitHub","Analisa versões de destino a partir de solicitações de usuário para um gerenciamento de lançamento eficiente"],"ru":["Автоматизация выпусков версий TransFlow в GitHub","Генерация вложений DMG для выпусков GitHub","Парсинг целевых версий из запросов пользователя для эффективного управления выпусками"],"ar":["تأتمة إصدارات إصدارات TransFlow إلى GitHub","توليد مرفقات DMG لإصدارات GitHub","تحليل الإصدارات المستهدفة من طلبات المستخدم من أجل إدارة الإصدار الفعالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `gh` CLI installed and authenticated","Needs `create-dmg` installed","Dependent on Xcode Command Line Tools","Requires a clean working directory with no uncommitted changes unrelated to release"],"zh":["需要安装并认证 `gh` CLI","需要安装 `create-dmg`","依赖 Xcode 命令行工具","需要一个干净的工作目录，没有与发布无关的未提交更改"],"ja":["`gh` CLI がインストールされ認証されている必要がある","`create-dmg` がインストールされている必要がある","Xcode コマンドラインツールに依存","リリースに関係のない未コミットの変更がないクリーンな作業ディレクトリが必要"],"ko":["`gh` CLI가 설치되고 인증되어야 함","`create-dmg`가 설치되어야 함","Xcode 명령줄 도구에 의존","릴리스와 관련이 없는 커밋되지 않은 변경 사항이 없는 깨끗한 작업 디렉토리가 필요"],"es":["Requiere `gh` CLI instalado y autenticado","Necesita `create-dmg` instalado","Dependiente de Xcode Command Line Tools","Requiere un directorio de trabajo limpio sin cambios no confirmados no relacionados con la versión"],"fr":["Nécessite la CLI `gh` installée et authentifiée","Nécessite `create-dmg` installé","Dépendant de Xcode Command Line Tools","Nécessite un répertoire de travail propre sans changements non validés non liés à la version"],"de":["Benötigt `gh`-CLI installiert und authentifiziert","Benötigt `create-dmg` installiert","Abhängig von Xcode Command Line Tools","Benötigt ein sauberes Arbeitsverzeichnis ohne nicht übertragenen Änderungen, die nicht mit der Version verbunden sind"],"pt":["Exige que a CLI `gh` esteja instalada e autenticada","Necessita que a `create-dmg` esteja instalada","Dependente das Ferramentas de Linha de Comando do Xcode","Exige um diretório de trabalho limpo sem alterações não commitadas não relacionadas ao lançamento"],"ru":["Требует установки и аутентификации CLI `gh`","Требует установки `create-dmg`","Зависит от инструментов командной строки Xcode","Требует чистого рабочего каталога без 